<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- NGONI BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Linenu la Bwina liyandikwi na Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Linenu la Bwina liyandikwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maluko</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Linenu la Bwina liyandikwi na Maluko ndi chitabu chimonga pagati ya vitabu mcheche vya Lilaganu la Hinu vyevidandaula kutama kwa Yesu pamulima apa. Kila chitabu chikemelewa “Injili.” Mana yaki “Linenu la Bwina.” Na vitabu vyenivyo vyayandikwi na Matei na Maluko na Luka na Yohani peamali kufwa Yesu. Linenu la Bwina leliyandikwi na Maluko ndi chitabu chihupi neju pagati ya vitabu vyoha mcheche vya Linenu la Bwina. Mewa yisadikika kuvya ndi chitabu cha utumbulanu kuyandikwa muvitabu vyenivyo, na chayandikwi pagati ya mwaka 65 mbaka 70 peamali kuvelekewa Yesu. Vasomi vamahele visadika kuvya chayandikwi pamuji wa ku Loma ndava ya kuvakangamalisa mtima vandu vevakumsadika Yesu vevatama ku Loma kula.</para>
  <para style="ip">Liina lingi la Maluko lavi Yohani Maluko, ndi avi muyavi wa Mtumi Pauli na Banaba nambu alaumiwi pala peajiwusili mulugendu lwavi lwa kumhengela Chapanga, Matendu (musula, 13:13). Palongolo Maluko ahambili kavili lugendu na Banaba, Matendu (musula, 15:37-39). Maluko mewa amanyikini neju kuvya nkozi wa papipi wa Petili (1 Petili 5:13). Nambu Maluko avi msongolo mdebe lukumbi Yesu itumbula lihengu laki. Vasomi vamahele visadika kuvya Maluko ayandiki chitabu ichi kuhuma mumalongesi ga Petili ndava ya Yesu na malongesi ago ndi chanzu chikulu cha Chitabu ichi, mu Linenu la Bwina ili, Maluko ilongela neju ndava ya vawuliwa va Yesu na mawuliwu ga Yesu mulusenje lwa mulima.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Maluko itumbula kwa kuchilongelala chitabu chaki (musula, 1:1-13).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Maluko ijova ndava ya lihengu la Yesu peavili ku Galilaya (musula, 1:14-8:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Kavili ijova kuuvala lugendu lwa Yesu kuhamba ku Yelusalemu (musula, 8:22-10:52).</para>
  <para style="io">Maluko imalakisila mukuyandika malovi ga Yesu peavili ku Yelusalemu pamonga na kufwa kwa Yesu na kuyuka kwaki (musula, 11:1-16:8).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohani Mbatizaji itendelekela njila ndava ya Yesu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matei 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3-18">Luka 3-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohani 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Wenuwu ndi utumbula wa Linenu la Bwina la Yesu Kilisitu, Mwana wa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Yatumbwili ngati chaalotili Isaya mweavi mlota wa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Yuwanila, Chapanga ajovili, ‘Nikumtuma mjumbi wangu akulongolelayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">kukutendelekela njila yaku.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Mundu mmonga ijova kwa lwami luvaha kulugangatu, ‘Mumtendekela Bambu njila yaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">mgolosayi pala peibwela kupita!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohani Mbatizaji atamayi kulugangatu, akavakokosela vandu na kuvabatiza, akavajovela, “Mleka kumbudila Chapanga na mubatiziwa na Chapanga yati akuvalekekesa kumbudila kwinu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Vandu vamahele kuhuma pamulima woha wa ku Yudea na kumuji wa Yelusalemu vahambili kumuyuwanila Yohani, vayidakili kuvya vambudili Chapanga, namwene avabatizi mumfuleni Yoludani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohani awalili nyula zezatenganizwi kwa mangoma ga hinyama yeikemiwa ngamiya, akungi mkungi wa chikumba muchiwunu, alili mambalanguli na wuchi wa kudahi. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Ndi akakokosa akajova, “Mweibwela hinu naha mumbele yangu ana makakala kuliku nene. Nene nakuganikiwa hati kugundama kuwopola nyosi za champali zaki. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nene nikuvabatiza kwa manji, nambu mwene alavabatiza kwa Mpungu Msopi wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatiziwa na kulingiwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matei 3:13-4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Magono genago, Yesu abwelili kuhuma ku Nazaleti, muji wewavi ku Galilaya na akabatiziwa na Yohani mumfuleni Yoludani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yesu pahumili mumanji, akalola kunani kwa Chapanga kudindwiki, na Mpungu Msopi ihelela panani yaki ngati ngunda. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Lwami lwa Chapanga lukayuwanika kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, lukajova, “Veve ndi Mwana wa chiganu changu mweniganisiwi nayu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Bahapo Mpungu Msopi akamlongosa kuhamba kulugangatu, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />akatama kwenuko magono alobaini, kuni ilingiwa na Setani. Nambu avi pamonga na hinyama ya mdahi, na vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga vakavya kumtangatila.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakemela valova somba mcheche vamlanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matei 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Yohani peakungiwi muchifungu, Yesu akahamba ku Galilaya kuvakokosela vandu Linenu la Bwina la Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Akajova, “Lukumbi luhikili, Unkosi wa Chapanga uhegelili, hinu mleka kumbudila Chapanga na kusadika Linenu la Bwina!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yesu peapitayi mumhana ya nyanja Galilaya avaweni valova somba vavili. Avi Simoni na mlongo waki Andelea valovayi somba kwa ngwanda zavi mumanji.<figure style="fig" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" ref="1:16">Mundu ilova somba na ngwanda. </figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu akavajovela, “Munilandayi, na nene yati nikuvapela lihengu la kuvaleta vandu kwangu ngati chemwilova somba.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Bahapo ndi vakazileka ngwanda zavi vakamulanda.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesu peahegalili cha palongolo akavalola Yohani na mlongo waki Yakobo vana va Zebedayo vavi muwatu wavi vatengeneza ngwanda zavi. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Bahapo Yesu akavakemela, ndi vakamleka dadi wavi Zebedayo na vahenga lihengu vevavi muwatu, vakamulanda Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mweavi na mzuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vakahamba kumuji wa Kapelanaumu. Ligono la Kupumulila palahikili, Yesu akayingila munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi, akatumbula kuvawula malovi ga Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Vandu voha vevamuyuwini vakakangaswa neju namuna ya kuwula kwaki, muni awula lepi ngati Vawula va Malagizu, nambu awulayi ngati mundu mweavi na uhotola.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ndi lukumbi lulalula, mundu mweatalaliwi na mizuka avi munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi vakaywanga, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />akajova, “Yesu wa ku Nazaleti, ukutiganila kyani tete? Ubweli kutikomakesa? Nikumanyili veve ndi yani, veve ndi Wamsopi wa Chapanga!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu akauhakalila mzuka wula. Akaujovela, “Guna, muwuka mundu uyu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mzuka wula ukamnyugusa mundu yula kwa makakala kuni ukavembeneka kwa lwami luvaha, ukamuwuka mundu yula. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Vandu voha vakakangasa neju na kukotana, “Nakugalola mambu ngati aga? Chakaka mawuliwu aga gana uhotola! Mundu mwenuyu ihotola hati kuvinga mizuka mihakau na yene yeyidakila.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Kangi malovi gakumvala Yesu gakadandasika kanyata pamuji woha ku Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa vandu vamahele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matei 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki Yakobo na Yohani, vakawuka munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi vakahamba pamonga kunyumba ya Simoni na Andelea. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Mkohanu waki Simoni agonili palusongwani ndava alwalayi neju. Yesu pahikili pala ndi kanyata vakamjovela utamu wa mau yula. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu akamhambila mau yula, akamkamula chiwoko akamuyinula. Ndi utamu ula ukamleka, akatumbula kuvatelekela.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Kimihi, palatipimi lilanga vandu vamuletili Yesu vatamu na vandu vevatalaliwi na mizuka voha. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Vandu vamahele va muji wula vakalundimana kuvala ya mlyangu. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Namwene akavalamisa vandu vamahele vevalwalai matamu ndalindali, ayivingili mizuka yamahele yeyavatalali vandu, nambu nakuyileka mizuka yijova chindu muni yamanyili mwene ndi yani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikokosa ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Chilau yaki hambakucha, Yesu akahamba kuchiyepela akatumbula kumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Ndi Simoni na vayaki vakahamba kumlonda. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Pevamuweni vakamjovela, “Vandu voha vakukulonda.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu akavayangula, “Tihamba na mumiji yingi ya papipi nikakokosayi na kwenuko mewa muni nibweli ndava yeniyo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Hinu akahamba pandu poha pa Galilaya akakokosa munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi na kuyivinga mizuka.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu mweavi na mabudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matei 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Ligono limonga mundu mmonga mweavi na mabudi, amhambalili Yesu, akafugama, akamuyupa, “Ngati wigana uhotola kuninyambisa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu akamhengela lipyana akatalambula chiwoko na kumpamisa, akamjovela, “Nigana, unyambasikayi!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Bahapo mabudi gakamuwuka mundu yula akalama. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Kangi Yesu akamjovela, ahamba kanyata na kumlagiza, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Yuwanila, kotoka kumjovela mundu yoyoha lijambu lenili. Nambu uhamba ukajilangisa kwa Mteta na ukawusa luteta ndava ya kulama kwaku, ngati chehamwili Musa kulangisa kuvya ulamili.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Nambu mundu yula akahamba, akatumbula kudandaula malovi gala pandi zoha. Ndava yeniyo, hati Yesu nakuhotola kuyingila pamuji wowoha hotohoto, ndi yamuganili kutama kuchiyepela. Pamonga na genago vandu vamuhambalili kuhuma kila upandi.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu mweapoli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matei 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Gapitili magono Yesu akawuya kavili Kapelanaumu, vandu vakayuwana kuvya avili kunyumba. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Hinu, vandu vamahele vakambwelela vakamema mugati na kuvala hati kawaka nafwasi pamlyangu. Yesu avakokoselayi ujumbi waki. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Lukumbi lwenulo vakabwela vandu mcheche vamletili mundu mweapolili kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Nakuhotola kumuhikisa kwa Yesu ndava ya msambi wa vandu. Hinu vakapekenyula kuchituvilu pandu peavili Yesu. Pavamali kubowola pandu pala vakamuhelesa mundu yula kuni agonili pampasa. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu peayiwene sadika yavi akamjovela mundu mweapoli yula, “Mwana vangu, ulekekiswi kumbudila Chapanga waku.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Vawula vangi va Malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa vevatamili penapo vakaholalela mumitima yavi, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Ihotola wuli kujova genaga? Akumliga Chapanga! Kawaka mundu mweihotola kulekekesa kubuda nambu ndi mmonga Chapanga ndu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Bahapo Yesu agamanyili maholo gavi, akavajovela, “Ndava kyani mwiholalela mumitima yinu mambu ago? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Chindu choki changa hotoleka kumjovela mundu mweapolili, ‘Ulekekiswi kumbudila Chapanga,’ Amala ‘Yimuka, tola mpasa waku Uhambayi?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Nambu nigana mumanyayi kuvya Mwana wa Mundu ana uhotola pamulima wa kulekekesa vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga.” Ndi amjovili mwaapoli yula, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Nikukujovela, yimuka, tola mpasa waku uhamba kunyumba yaku!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Na vandu voha pavamlolokesa mundu yula, balapala akayima na kutola mpasa waki akahamba. Vandu voha vakakangasa na vakamlumbalila Chapanga, vakajova, “Katu nakulilola lijambu ngati lenilo hati padebe!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumkemela Lawi amlandayi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matei 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu akawuka penapo akahamba pamuhana ya nyanja ya ku Galilaya. Ndi msambi wa vandu wamulandili, mwene akatumbula kuvawula. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ndi paagendayi amuweni Lawi mwana wa Alufayo atamili munyumba ya kutolela kodi. Yesu akamjovela, “Bwela nilandayi.” Ndi Lawi akayima akamulanda.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Mwanakandayi Yesu avi kunyumba ya Lawi ilya chakulya. Vatola kodi vamahele na vandu vevajovekini kuvya vakumbudila Chapanga na vevamlandayi Yesu. Na vamahele wavi valili chakulya na Yesu pamonga na vawuliwa vaki. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Hinu, Pagati ya vawula vangi va Malagizu vevavi Vafalisayu pavamuweni Yesu ilya pamonga na vandu vevajovikini kuvya vakumbudila Chapanga na vatola kodi, vakavakota vawuliwa vaki, “Ndava kyani ilya pamonga na vandu ngati ava?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu peayuwini akavajovela, “Vangalwala nakumgana mlamisa, nambu vatamu ndi vevakumgana mlamisa. Nabweli lepi kuvakemela vandu vabwina, nambu nabweli ndava ya kuvakemela vevajovikini kuvya vakumbudila Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lijambu la kujihinisa chakulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matei 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Lukumbi lumonga vawuliwa va Yohani na Vafalisayu vavi mukujihinisa kulya chakulya. Vandu vangi vakamkota Yesu, “Ndava kyani vawuliwa va Yohani na va Vafalisayu vakujihinisa kulya chakulya nambu vawuliwa vaku nakukita genago?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu akayangula, “Wu, vevagongoliwi kumselebuko wa ndowa yikuvagana kujihinisa chakulya kuni vavi pamonga na mkolo ndowa? Nakuhotola kujihinisa chakulya lukumbi lwoha pevivya na mkolo ndowa. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Nambu yati lubwela lukumbi lwa mkolo ndowa paiwusiwa pagati yavi, lukumbi ulo ndi pavakujihinisa chakulya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Kawaka mundu mweitota chilaka cha nyula ya mupya mulindimula la nyula. Ngati akakita chenichi chilaka cha mupya yati chinyalala na chipapula lindimula lenilo neju. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Avi lepi mundu mweisopa divayi ya mupya mumahaku gachikumba gegalalili. Ngati akakitayi chenicho, divayi peyitutumuka yati yipapula mahaku ga chikumba gala na divayi pamonga na mahaku ga chikumba yati gipapuka na kuyitika. Divayi ya mupya yisopewa mumahaku gamupya!”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu wa Ligono la Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matei 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ligono limonga la Kupumulila, Yesu pamonga na vawuliwa vaki vapitayi mumgunda wa nganu. Vawuliwa vaki vakatumbula kudenya njechela ga nganu kuni vigenda. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Vafalisayu vakamkota Yesu, “Lola hoti! Ndava kyani vawuliwa vaku vikita lijambu lelibesiwi pa Ligono la Kupumulila?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu akavayangula, “Wu, mwangasoma cheakitili Daudi na vayaki njala peyavavinili? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Daudi ayingili mu Nyumba ya Chapanga na kulya mabumunda yeyavikiwi luteta ndava ya Chapanga. Lijambu lenili lakitiki lukumbi Abiasali avili Mteta Mkulu. Kulandana na Malagizu ndi vakulu va kuteta vene ndu vevaganikiwa kulya mabumunda genago. Nambu Daudi alili, na kuvapela vayaki.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Hinu, Yesu akavajovela, “Ligono la Kupumulila lavikiwi ndava ya kuvatangatila vandu, lepi vandu kulihengela Ligono la Kupumulila. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Hinu, Mwana wa Mundu ndi Bambu hati pa Ligono la Kupumulila.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu mweagogodili chiwoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matei 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yesu akayingila kavili munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi na mugati mula kwavili na mundu mweagogodili chiwoko. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Mugati mula kwavi na vandu vangi pagati yavi valindilayi kumlola Yesu, ngati akumlamisa mundu yula Ligono la Kupumulila, muni valonda chindu cha kumtakila. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu akamjovela mundu yula mweagogodili chiwoko, “Bwela uyima palongolo ya vandu.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Kangi Yesu akavakota, “Malagizu gitu yijova wuli pa Ligono la Kupumulila? Chabwina kumtangatila mundu amala kumlemasa? Kusangula amala kukoma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Nambu vene vakaguna. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu akavalolokesa voha cha ligoga, mtima ukamvina ndava ya kunonopa kwa mitima yavi. Kangi akamjovela mundu yula “Golosayi chiwoko chaku.” Namwene akachigolosa ndi chikalama kavili. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Bahapo Vafalisayu vakahuma kuvala, vakajovesana pamonga na vandu va chikundi cha Helodi ndava ya mpangu wa kumkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambi wa vandu pamuhana ya nyanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vakawuka penapo, vakahamba pamhana ya nyanja na msambi wa vandu wamulandili. Vandu venavo vahumili ku Galilaya na ku Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />na ku Yelusalemu na ku Idumea na kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani na ku Tilo na Sidoni. Vandu venavo vamahele vamuhambalili Yesu ndava ya kuyuwana mambu gamahele geakitili. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Ndava ya msambi wa vandu Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki vamutendelekela watu udebe, ndava ya kuyepa msambi wa vandu ukoto kumuhinya. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ndava avalamisi vandu vamahele, hinu voha vevavi na matamu vakavya kumuhinya muni vahotola kumpamisa. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Vandu vevatalaliwi na mizuka mihakau ndi kila pavamuwene Yesu vakagwilingana palongolo yaki, na kuywanga, “Veve ndi Mwana wa Chapanga!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Nambu Yesu akayihakalila kwa makakala mizuka mihakau yila yikotoka kummanyisa kwa vandu.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahagula vamitumi kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matei 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Kangi Yesu akahamba kuchitumbi akavakemela veavaganili, ndi vakamhambila, <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />mwene akavahagula vandu kumi na vavili akavakemela vamitumi, muni vavyai pamonga nayu muni avatuma kukokosa, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />mewa vavyai na uhotola wa kuvinga mizuka.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Hinu, kumi na vavili vevahaguliwi vala. Simoni ndi Yesu ampeli liina la Petili, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />na Yakobo na Yohani vana va Zebedayo, venavo Yesu avapeli valongo vavili liina lingi avakemili Bonelige, mana yaki “Vana va Kubuluma amala, vandu va chipyau.” <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Vangi vavi Andelea na Filipi na Batolomei na Matei na Tomasi na Yakobo mwana wa Alufayo na Tadayo na Simoni mweikemiwa Zeloti, ndava avili mundu wa kukengelela mulima waki, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yuda Isikalioti mweabweli kumugeukila Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matei 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Kangi Yesu akahamba kunyumba, kwenuko msambi wa vandu ukamlanda kavili, Yesu na vawuliwa vaki nakuvya na nafwasi ya kulya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Hinu valongo vaki pevayuwini genago, vakawuka kuhamba kumkamula muni vaholalela manya ipenga.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Pagati ya vawula vangi va Malagizu vevahelili kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, vakajova, “Mwenuyu atalaliwi na Belizebuli! Kwa makakala ga mkulu wa mizuka akuyivinga mizuka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yesu akavakemela akavajovela kwa miluhumu, “Setani ihotola wuli kumvinga Setani? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ngati unkosi umonga ulekangini chikundi chikundi weutovana, unkosi wenuwo nakuhotola kusindimala. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ngati vandu va nyumba yimonga valekangini chikundi chikundi yati yigwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Hinu ngati, unkosi wa Setani ulekangini chikundi chikundi, wisindimala lepi, ndi wivya lepi na makakala.”<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Avi lepi mundu mweihotola kuzangila nyumba ya mundu mweavi na makakala na kumnyaga vindu vyaki changali hoti kumkunga mundu mwenuyo. Penapo ndi yati ihotola kumnyaga vindu vyaki.”<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Chakaka nikuvajovela, vandu yativilekesewa kumbudila Chapanga kwoha na kumliga kwavi kwoha. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Nambu mweakumliga Mpungu Msopi, katu Chapanga akumlekekesa lepi, ndi ivya mbudingana wa magono goha gangali mwishu.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu ajovili genago ndava vandu vajovili kuvya, “Ana mzuka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyina na valongo vaki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matei 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nyina wa Yesu na valongo vaki vakabwela vakayima pavala, vakamtuma mundu mmonga akamkemela mugati mula. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Msambi wa vandu watamili kumtindila Yesu mundu mmonga akamjovela, “Lola nyina waku na valongo vaku vavi kuvala, vakukulonda.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu akavajovela, “Nyina wangu na valongo vangu ndi vayani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Kangi akavalola voha vevatamili kumtindila mwene, akajova “Mlola! Nikuvalola ava ngati Nyina wangu na valongo vangu. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Mundu yoyoha yula mweihenga gakumganisa Chapanga, mwenuyo ndi mhaja wangu kavili mlumbu wangu mewa nyina wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mundu mweimija mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matei 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu akatumbula kuvawula kavili kumwambu ya nyanja ya Galilaya. Ndava ya msambi uvaha wa vandu wewamtindili yaganikiwi ayingila muwatu na kutama, vandu voha vasigalili kundumba. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Ndi penapo avawuli mambu gamahele kwa miluhumu, akavajovela.<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Muyuwanila hoti! Mundu mmonga ahambili kumgunda kumija mbeyu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Hinu paamijayi mbeyu, zingi zikagwilila munjila, videge vikabwela kuhola. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Mbeyu zingi zikagwilila palitalau, zikamela kanyata pandu pangali na ludaka lwamahele. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Lilanga palachonayi zanyalili na kuyuma, muni mikiga yaki yavi lepi na ludaka lwamahele. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Zingi zagwili pagati ya minga, minga yakulili na kuyihinya hati zapambiki lepi matunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Zingi zagwili paludaka lwa bwina, zikamela zikakula na kupambika yimonga selasini na yingi sitini na yingi miya yimonga.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Ndi akavajovela, “Mweavi na makutu gakuyuwana na amanyayi!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chechilongeliwi ndava ya miluhumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matei 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Yesu peavili mwene, pagati ya vevamuyuwanili vala na vawuliwa kumi na vavili, vamuhambalili Yesu vakamkota, ndava ya miluhumu yila. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Akavajovela, “Nyenye mupewili kugamanya mambu ga mfiyu ga Unkosi wa Chapanga.” “Nambu vevavi kuvala vala yati vakujiwula kwa miluhumu ndu, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />muni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Chakaka valolayi, nambu vilola lepi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">chakaka vayuwana, nambu vimanya lepi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Manya vamuwuyila Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">namwene ngaavalekekisi.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu idandaula luhumu lwa mundu mweimija mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matei 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Kangi Yesu akavakota, “Ngati mwimanya lepi mana ya luhumu ulu? Mwihotola wuli kuyimanya mana za miluhumu yingi? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mweimija mbeyu ndi imija Linenu la Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Mbeyu zingi zagwilili munjila, ndi vandu vala vevayuwini linenu, Setani akabwela na kuliwusa linenu lenilo lelimijiwi mumitima yavi. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Mbeyu zila zezamijiwi palitalau ndi ngati vandu vala, veviyuwana linenu bahapo vakulipokela kwa luheku. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Nambu likuvayingila lepi nakuvya na mikiga mugati yavi, vakulikamula mulukumbi luhupi ndu. Na lukumbi lwa mang'ahiso peluhumila ndava ya linenu lenilo, vikuvanduka na kugwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Vandu vangi ndi ngati mbeyu zila zezagwilili pagati ya minga. Wenuwo ndi luhumu lwa vala veviyuwana linenu lenilo, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ndava ya mang'ahiso ga mulima uwu, mnogo wa kuvya na vindu vyamahele mnogo wa higa ukuvayingila na kulihinya linenu lenilo, na vene viyidikila lepi chila chelijova linenu. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Nambu vandu vangi ngati mbeyu zezimijiwi paludaka lwabwina. Venavo ndi veviyuwana linenu lenilo, vakuliyidakila na kupambika matunda. Vangi selasini, vangi sitini na vangi miya yimonga.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa hahi yeyigubikwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu akavakota, “Mwaloli koki vandu vigubika hahi yeyiyaka na chiviga amala vivika kuhi kulusongwani? Lepi! Vivika panani pachibokoselu. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Hinu, goha gegafiyiki yati givya pawaka na goha gegagubikiwi yati gigubukuliwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Mweavi na makutu gakuyuwana na amanyayi!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Akavajovela kavili, “Myuwanila chipimu chilachila chemukuvapimila vayinu, na nyenye yati mwipimiwa mewawa, na kuyonjokeswa. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Mundu yeyoha mweavi na chindu yati iyonjokesewa neju, nambu mweangavya na chindu hati chidebe ndi hati cheavi nachu yati inyagiwa.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mbeyu yeyimeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu akayendelela kuvajovela, “Unkosi wa Chapanga uvi ngati mundu mweimija mbeyu mumgunda waki. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Kilu igona, na muhi ivya mihu na lukumbi lwenulo mbeyu yimela na kukula. Mwene amanyili lepi chechihengeka. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Muni ludaka lwene lumelesa mbeyu. Yikula na kupambika. Yitumbula kumela linyai, yigelekela njechela na pamwishu mbeyu yikangala. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Mbeyu peyikangala mundu mwenuyo itola chikwakwa na kutumbula kubena muni lukumbi lwa mabenu luhikili.”<figure style="fig" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" ref="4:29">Mundu ibena kwa kuhengela chikwakwa</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mbeyu yidebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matei 13:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu akajova kavili, “Unkosi wa Chapanga tiuwanangisa na kyani? Tiudandaulayi kwa luhumu lwoki? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Uwanangana ngati lumbeyu lwa haladali lweluvili ludebe kuliku mbeyu zoha zezimijiwa mumgunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Nambu yikamijiwayi, yimela na kuvya mkongo uvaha kuliku mikongo yoha mumgunda. Mambanda gaki gavaha hati videge vijenga hisakanilu mumambanda gaki.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu avakokosili vandu ujumbi waki kwa miluhumu yingi yamahele ngati yeniyo, alongili nawu chavahotwili kumanya. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Lukumbi lwoha alongili nawu lepi chochoha changali miluhumu nambu paavi na vawuliwa vaki avadandaulili kila chindu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu igunisa luyuga na manji gakutimbugana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matei 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Lilanga palatipimi ligono lilolo, Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Tikupuka kumwambu.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Hinu, vawuliwa vakaulaga msambi wa vandu, vakayingila muwatu weavili Yesu na kuwuka pamonga nayu. Na vandu vakayingila muwatu wungi vakamlanda. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Pavakupukayi, mpungu uvaha ukahumila manji gakutimbungana na kuutova watu na manji gakatumbula kumema muwatu.<figure style="fig" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" ref="4:37">Watu mumanji gakutimbugana</figure> <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Penapo Yesu avi mumbele ya watu kuni agonili pamsagamilu. Ndi vawuliwa vaki vakamuyimusa vakamkota, “Muwula, wuli, tifwaa ukutilolokesa ndu!”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Hinu, akayimuka, akauhakalila mpungu na kuujovela luyuga lwa manji, “Guna!” Ndi penapo mpungu wula ukaleka kubuma na nyanja yikavya nuu. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Mwiyogopa kyani? Wu, mwakona kusadika?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ndi penapo vavi na wogohi neju, vakatumbula kukotana, “Mundu uyu yani? Mbaka mpungu na manji gakutimbungana vikumyuwana na kuguna!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu mweavi na mizuka mihakau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matei 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vakahika kumwambu ya nyanja ya Galilaya, pamulima wa Vagelasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Bahapo Yesu peahulwiki muwatu mula akakonganeka na mundu mweavi na mzuka mweahumili kumatinda. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Mundu mwenuyo atamayi kumbugu la litinda. Kawaka mundu mweahotwili kumkunga kavili hati kwa minyololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Pamahele valingi kumkunga pingu na minyololo mumagendelu na mu mawoko, nambu pamahele adaulini pingu na minyololo. Avi lepi mundu mweavi na makakala gakumhotola. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Kilu na muhi atamayi ku matinda na muvidunda aywangayi na kujidumulana na maganga.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Mundu mwenuyo paamuweni Yesu cha kutali, akamjumbalila, na kumfugamila. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Akajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Yesu, Mwana wa Chapanga mweavi Kunani Neju, una kyani na nene? Kwa liina la Chapanga, nikuyupa kotoka kuning'aha!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ajovili genago ndava Yesu amali kumjovela, “Mzuka, muwuka mundu uyu!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Kangi Yesu akamkota, “Liina laku yani?” Mwene akayangula, “Liina langu ‘Msambi’ Ndava tivii tavamahele!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Kangi akamuyupa Yesu neju akotoka kuvavinga pamulima pala.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Papipi na mhelelu wa chitumbi, kwavi na maguluvi gamahele gegalyayi. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Hinu mizuka yila yikamuyupa Yesu yikajova, “Utiyidakilayi tikagayingila maguluvi gala.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Akagayidakila. Ndi mizuka yila yikawuka na kuyingila mumaguluvi gala. Na msambi woha wa maguluvi wavi ngati elufu zivili, ukajumba pamhelelu wa chitumbi na kudumbukila mumanji na kufwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Hinu vadimaji va maguluvi vala vakajumba, kuvadandaulila vandu mambu genago kumuji na kumigunda. Vandu vakavya kubwelenela penapo kugalola mambu genago. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Vakahika mbaka pala peavi Yesu, vakamlola mundu mweatalaliwi na msambi wa mizuka yula. Atamili pahi na awalili nyula na luhala lwaki lumuwuyili, ndi vakayogopa. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Vandu voha vevaloli lijambu lenilo vakavajovela vayavi mambu gala gegamkolili mundu yula na kugavala maguluvi gala.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Hinu, vakamuyupa Yesu awuka pamulima wavi.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu paayingila muwatu, mundu mweatalaliwi na mizuka yula akamuyupa neju vahamba voha.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Nambu Yesu akambelelela mundu yula akamjovela, “Uhambayi ukavajovela vandu va kunyumba yaku Bambu gabwina geakukitili na cheakuhengili lipyana.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Kangi mundu yula akahamba ku Dekapoli kwoha ndi miji kumi, akavadandaulila vandu va mambu goha geahengiwi na Yesu. Na vandu voha vakakangasa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulamiswa kwa mdala mmonga na msikana mwana wa Yailo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matei 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu akakupuka kavili kumwambu ya nyanja. Peavili kwenuko msambi wa vandu ukambwelenela, mwene avili pamuhana ya nyanja. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Akabwela chilongosi mmonga wa nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi liina laki Yailusi, hinu paamuwene Yesu, akamfugamila pamagendelu gaki, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />akamuyupa neju akamjovela, “Pepayi msikana wangu mdebe avi mulung'olelu. Chondi tihambi ukamuvikila mawoko gaku, muni ihotola kulama na kuvya mumi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu pamonga na mundu yula vakalongosana kuhamba. Msambi wa vandu ukamulanda na kumuhinya pandi zoha.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Pagati yavi kwavili na mdala mmonga, mwealwalayi utamu wa kuhuma ngasi mulukumbi lwa miyaka kumi na yivili. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Mdala mwenuyo amali kung'ahika neju na kumala mashonga gaki goha, kwa valamisa vamahele ndava ya kulonda kulama, nambu utamu waki wayonjokisiki neju. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Mau yula peayuwini kuvya Yesu akuvalamisa vandu ndi akaholota mumbela ya msambi wa vandu wula na kuhamba kupamisa nyula ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Akitili chenicho, muni aholalili kuvya, “Nakahotola kupamisa nyula ya Yesu yati nilama.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Peampamisi bahapo akamanya kuvya alamili, muni ngasi yeyahuma yila yikaleka. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Yesu akamanya ngati makakala gaki zimulamisi mundu. Akang'anamuka, akakota, “Yani mweanipamisi nyula yangu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Vawuliwa vaki vakamyangula, “Ndava kyani wikota yani mweakupamisi? Wu, ukuvalola lepi vandu chevakuhinya?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Nambu Yesu akayendelela akalolokesa pandi zoha mundu mweampamisi nyula yaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Mdala yula kuni imanya gegamkolili akavya na wogohi, akahegelela peavi Yesu kuni ivagaya, ndi akamfugamilila Yesu akamjovela goha kwa uchakaka. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu akamjovela, “Msikana wangu, sadika yaku yikulamisi, uhambayi na uteke, utamu waku ulamili.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu palongelayi na mundu yula, lukumbi lulalula vakabwela vajumbi kuhuma kunyumba ya Yailo chilongosi wa nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi akamjovela. “Msikana waku afwili, kyani kumung'aha Muwula?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yesu agayuwini malovi gala, nambu agavevisi akamjovela mkulu wa nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi yula, “Kotoka kuvya na wogohi, yendelela kusadika.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu ayidakili lepi kulongosana na mundu yoyoha nambu Petili na Yakobo na Yohani muhaja wa Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Pavahikili kunyumba ya Yailo, Yesu avayuwini vandu vivembeneka neju ndava ya malilu. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Akayingila mugati akavajovela, “Ndava kyani mwiywanga na kuvemba? Msikana uyu afwili lepi, pena agonili ndu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Nambu vene vakamuheka. Akavahumisa kuvala vandu voha vevavi mugati mula, akavatola dadi na nyina wa msikana yula, pamonga na vawuliwa vaki vadatu, ndi vakayingila muchumba cheavili msikana yula. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Akamkamula chiwoko, akamjovela, “Talita, kumu,” Mana yaki, “Wamsikana, nikujovela yimuka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Bahapo msikana yula akayimuka na kutumbula kugenda, vandu voha vakakangasa neju. Msikana mwenuyo avi na miyaka kumi na yivili. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Nambu Yesu akavabesa vakotoka kumjovela mundu yoyoha yula. Akavajovela vampela chakulya alyayi.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Vandu vakumbelela Yesu ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matei 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki, vakawuka penapo vakahamba kuchijiji chaki cha ku Nazaleti. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ligono la Kupumulila, atumbwili kuwula munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi. Vamahele vevamuyuwini vakangisi, vakajova, “Wu, agapatili koki mambu aga geijova? Apatili koki luhala ulu? Kavili ikita wuli gachinamtiti? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Wu, mwenuyu lepi selemala, mwana wa Maliya na mlongo wavi Yakobo na Yose na Yuda na Simoni? Wu, valumbu vaki titama nawu lepi bahapa?” Ndi vakabela kumsadika.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu akavajovela, “Mlota wa Chapanga itopeswa kila pandi, lepi kunyumba yaki, kwa valongo vaki na pamulima waki.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Ndava yeniyo Yesu akitili lepi mambu gachinamtiti pala, ndi avavikili mawoko vatamu vadebedebe akavalamisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Akangisi neju ndava ya vandu vangasadika.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu akuvatuma vawuliwa kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:15">Matei 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Kangi Yesu avigendalili muhijiji ya papipi na kuvawula vandu.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Akavakemela vawuliwa kumi na vavili, akatumbula akavatuma vandu vavili vavili, akavapela uhotola wa kuvinga mizuka. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Akavalagiza akajova, “Kwemwihamba uko, mukotoka kugega chindu chochoha chila ndonga ndu, lepi chakulya, lihaku, amala mashonga pachilolo. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Muwala champali nambu mkotoka kugega ligwanda lingi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Akavajovela, “Nyumba yeyoha yevakuvapokela mutama bahapo mbaka pa ligono lemuwuka. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Kwa vandu vevibela kuvapokela amala kuvayuwanila, penapo ndi muwuka na muvakung'undila lububu lwavi, kulangisa kuvya vene vaubeli ujumbi wa Chapanga!”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Hinu, vakawuka penapo vakahamba kuvakokosela vandu vamuwuyila Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Vakayivinga mizuka vamahele. Na kuvanyala mahuta ga zeituni vatamu vamahele, vakavalamiswa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohani Mbatizaji ikomiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matei 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Nkosi Helodi agayuwini goha, muni malovi ga Yesu gayenili pandi zoha. Vandu vangi vajovayi mwenuyu, “Ndi Yohani Mbatizaji ayukili! Ndava muni ihenga gachinamtiti.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Vangi vakajova, “Mwenuyu ndi Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Vangi vakajova, “Mwenuyu ndi mmonga wa valota va Chapanga va kadeni.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Nambu Helodi peayuwini malovi gala akajova, “Yohani namdumwili mutu, hinu ayukili!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Aholalili genago ndava mu magono ga mumbele, Helodi alagazili Yohani akamuliwa na kukungiwa muchifungu. Genago gahumalili ndava Helodi amgegili Helodiya mdala wa Filipi mweavi mlongo waki. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yohani amjovelayi Helodi, “Chabwina lepi veve kumtola mdala wa mlongo waku.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Hinu Helodiya, mweavi mdala wa nkosi, amuhakalili neju Yohani, akagana kumkoma, nambu ahotwili lepi. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Helodi amuyogwipi Yohani muni amanyili kuvya Yohani ndi mundu wa msopi na mbwina. Ndava yeniyo amyangalili. Helodi aganayi kumuyuwanila Yohani, pamonga amyuwanili mtima wamvinili.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ligono limonga mdala wa nkosi apatili fwasi pa ligono la kukumbukwa kwa kuvelekewa Helodi. Hinu akavakemela vagogo va libanji na vachilongosi va Galilaya pamonga na vakulu va manjolinjoli. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Hinu msikana waki Helodiya, akayingila na kutumbula kukina ngo'ma. Hinu akavahekesa neju Helodi na vayehe vaki. Nkosi akamjovela msikana yula, “Uniyupa chindu chochoha chila na nene yati nikupela.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kavili akamlapakisa, akamjovela, “Chochoha cheukuniyupa, yati nikupela, hati ngati kugavana upinga wa unkosi wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Penapo msikana yula akawuka mugati mu libanji, akahamba kumkota nyina waki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">“Wigana niyupa kyani?” Namwene akamyangula, “Mutu wa Yohani Mbatizaji.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Msikana yula akawuya kanyata kavili kwa nkosi, akamjovela, “Nigana unipela hinu naha mulupalu mutu wa Yohani Mbatizaji.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Nkosi peayuwini genago, akavya ngolongondi, nambu muni ajilapakisi mwene, na ndava ya vayehe vaki, ahotwili lepi kumbelelela msikana yula ndi akamyidikila. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Hinu, akamlagiza linjolinjoli akaleta mutu wa Yohani. Linjolinjoli akahamba kuudumula mutu wa Yohani muchifungu mula, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />kangi amletili mutu wula mulupalu akampela msikana, namwene akampelekela nyina waki. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Vawuliwa va Yohani pevayuwini vakahamba kutola higa yaki vakahamba kuzika.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilisa msambi wa vandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:13-21">Matei 1:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohani 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Vamitumi vakawuya mulugendu lwavi vakamjovela Yesu, mambu goha gavakitili na chavawulili vandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Vandu vamahele neju vabwelayi na kuwuka kwa Yesu, ndi mbaka fwasi ya kulya yavi lepi. Hinu Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa, “Tihamba kuchiyepela mukapumulila padebe.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Hinu, vakawuka ngavene muwatu vakahamba kuchiyepela.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Nambu vandu vamahele vavaweni pavawukayi, vakavamanya. Ndi vakalongolela kuhika kula kwa magendelu kweahambayi Yesu na vawuliwa vaki. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki pevahulwiki muwatu kumbwani, ndi auweni msambi uvaha wa vandu, akaviniswa mtima, muni vavi ngati limbelele langali mdimaji. Akatumbula kuvawula mambu gamahele. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Lilanga palatipimi, ndi vawuliwa vaki vakahamba kumjovela Yesu, “Penapa palugangatu, lilanga litipama. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Mbanga uvalaga vandu vahamba mumigunda na muhijiji ya papipi, vakagula vyakulya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesu akavajovela, “Muvapela nyenye chakulya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Nambu vene vakamkota, “Tivapela kyani? Yati yikutigana tihenga lihengu kwa miyehi yamahele ndi tipatayi mashonga ga kuvagulila chakulya vandu voha ava?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu akavakota, “Mabumunda gavi galinga? Muhamba mukalola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Pevamali kulola vakawuya kumjovela, “Yivii mhanu na somba zivili.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Yesu akavalagiza vawuliwa vaki vavatamika vandu voha chikundi chikundi pahi pamanyai. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Hinu vene vakatama chikundi chikundi, vingi vandu hamsini, na vingi vandu miya. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Kangi Yesu akagatola mabumunda mhanu na somba zila, akalola kunani kwa Chapanga, akamsengusa Chapanga. Ndi akagametula mabumunda gala pamonga na somba zila. Akavapela vawuliwa vaki muni vavagavanisila vandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Vandu voha vevavi penapo valili vakayukuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Hinu, vakanonga masigalilu ga mabumunda na somba vakamemesa madengu kumi na gavili. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Vevalili chakulya chila, vavi vagosi elufu mhanu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu igenda panani ya manji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matei 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohani 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Bahapo Yesu akavalagiza vawuliwa vaki vayingila muwatu valongolela kuhamba kumwambu ya nyanja, kumuji wa Betisaida. Muni mwene avi akona ilagana na msambi wa vandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Hati peamali kulagana na vandu, akahamba kuchitumbi kumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Lilanga palatipimi, Yesu avi mwene kundumba na watu wamali kuhika pagati ya nyanja. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Mwene avaweni vawuliwa chaving'ahika muwatu mula na mipundi muni mpungu wavi uvaha ukuvawuyisa mumbele. Hinu hambakucha, Yesu avahegalili kuni igenda mumanji akagana kuvapita. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Nambu pavamuweni igenda panani ya manji vayogwipi, vaholali kuvya lihoka, “Vakaywanga mulete.” <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Voha pavamuweni vayogwipi neju.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Bahapo Yesu akajova nawu, “Mjipolesa mtima. Ndi nene. Mkoto kuyogopa!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ndi, akayingila muwatu wevavili vawuliwa na mpungu wa luyuga lukaguna lukumbi lulalula. Vawuliwa vakakangasa neju, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />ndava muni vamanyili lepi mana chinamtiti cha kuyonjokeseka chakulya chila ndava ya kunonopa kwa mitima yavi.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa vatamu ku Genezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matei 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Vakakupuka nyanja, vakahika kumuji wa ku Genezaleti vakahuyimika watu. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Pevahumili muwatu mula, kanyata vandu vakammanya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Hinu, kanyata vakahamba kila chijiji pandu pala, vakatumbula kuvatola vatamu vevagonili mumipasa, vakavapeleka kila pevayuwini Yesu avili. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Pandu poha peahambili Yesu, muhijiji na mumiji na mumigunda, vandu vavavikili vatamu pandu pakugulisila vindu, vandu vakamuyupa neju avayidakila vatamu vala, vapamisayi lugunyilu lwa nyula yaki. Ndi voha vevampamisi valamili.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu gevapokili kwa Vagogo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matei 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Kangi Vafalisayu vangi na Vawula va Malagizu vevahumili ku Yelusalemu valundumini palongolo ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Vavaweni vawuliwa vangi va Yesu vilya chakulya kwa mawoko changasamba ngati cheyiganikiwa na malagizu.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Muni Vafalisayu na Vayawudi vangi vayovalili kulanda mivelu ya vagogo wavi, muni valyayi lepi changasamba mawoko bwina. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Kavili vakagula chakulya kuhuma pandu pakugulisila vindu, vilya lepi mbaka vasanja hoti. Mewa vavi na mivelu yingi ya namuna ya kusanja vikombi na viviga na vyombo ya shaba.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Hinu, Vafalisayu na Vawula va Malagizu vangi vakamkota Yesu, “Ndava kyani vawuliwa vaku vilanda lepi mambu ga kadeni kuhuma kwa vagogo vitu, ndava vilya changasamba mawoko?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu akavayangula, “Vandu mwavahomela! Isaya mweavi Mlota wa Chapanga, alotili chakaka kuvavala nyenye peayandiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Chapanga ijova, vandu venava vakunitopesa kwa malovi ndu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">nambu mitima yavi yivii kutali na nene.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Kunigundamila kwavi chindu lepi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">muni mambu geviwula ndi malagizu ga vandu ndu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">Ngati malagizu ga Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Nyenye mulekili mihilu ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:8">na kukamulila mawuliwu ga vandu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu akayendelela kujova, “Nyenye mumanyili kuyepa cha kuchenjela mihilu ya Chapanga na kulanda mivelu yinu! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Muni Musa alagizi, ‘Muvatopesa dadi waku na nyina waku,’ Na, ‘Mweakumliga dadi waki amala nyina waki, yikumugana akomiwa.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Nambu nyenye muwula, ngati mundu avi na chindu chakumtangatila dadi waki amala nyina waki, nambu akajova, chindu chenicho ndi ‘Kolibani,’ Mana yaki njombi kwa Chapanga, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />hinu yikumugana lepi kumtangatila dadi waki amala nyina waki. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Chenichi ndi chemukulivevesa Linenu la Chapanga ndava ya mawuliwu ga kuhalilana. Kangi mkita mambu gamahele ngati genago.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mambu gegakumuhakasa mundu palongolo ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matei 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu aukemili kangi msambi wa vandu, akavajovela, “Muniyuwanilayi mwavoha na kumanya malovi aga. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kawaka chakulya cheilya mundu chechihotola kumuhakasa palongolo ya Chapanga. Nambu mambu gegihuma mugati ya mundu ndi gegihotola kumuhakasa. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Mweavi na makutu ga kuyuwana na amanyayi!”<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Paaulekili msambi wa vandu na kuyingila mu nyumba, vawuliwa vaki vakamkota mana ya luhumu lula. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Mwene akavajovela, “Wu, hati nyenye mwimanya lepi? Kawaka chakulya chechikumyingila mundu chihotola lepi, kumuhakasa mundu palongolo ya Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ndava muni chikumyingila lepi mumtima, nambu mulutumbu, kangi chihumiswa kundindima.” Ndava ya kujova chenicho Yesu ayidikili vyakulya vyoha viliwayi.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yesu akayendelela kujova, “Chechihuma mumtima wa mundu chihotola kumuhakasa palongolo ya Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Muni mugati ya mumtima wa mundu, gihuma maholo gahakau, ukemi na kuyiva na kukoma, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />ugoni na unota na udesi na uhakau na kuyiva na kunogela vindu vya vangi na luhonda na wihu na ng'omo na uyimu na maligu. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Gahakau goha ago gihuma mumtima wa mundu, genago ndi gakumhakasa mundu palongolo ya Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusadika kwa mdala angali Myawudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matei 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu awukili penapo akahamba kumuji wa Tilo. Kwenuko ayingili munyumba yimonga, mwene aganili lepi mundu amanyayi kuvya avili mugati, nambu ahotwili lepi kujifiya. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Mdala mmonga, msikana waki avili na mzuka, peayuwini malovi ga Yesu, kanyata akabwela akafugama palongolo ya magendelu ga Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mdala mwenuyo, avi Mgiliki, ndi mkolonjinji wa muji wa Foinike mulima wa ku Silia. Hinu akamuyupa Yesu amuwusa mzuka msikana waki. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesu akavajovela, vana vayukuta hoti, “Chabwina lepi kutola chakulya cha kuvayukutisa vana na kugatagila mabwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Nambu mdala yula akamyangula, “Chakaka, Bambu, hati mabwa gegavi pahi ya meza gilya masigalilu ga chakulya cha vana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu akamjovela, “Ndava ya linenu lenilo, wuyayi kunyumba yaku. Mzuka umuwukili msikana waku!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Hinu, akahamba kunyumba yaki, amkolili msikana waki agonili palusongwani, na mzuka wamali kumuwuka.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa ngajova mweavi ngayuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Kangi Yesu akawuka kumuji wa Tilo, akapitila pagati ya ku Sidoni, akahamba mbaka kunyanja ya Galilaya kuvedukila pamulima wa Dekapoli mana yaki miji kumi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ndi vakamletela ngayuwa nambu mewawa avi ngajova kwa Yesu, vakamuyupa amvikilayi mawoko muni amlamisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu akamvika pamuhana na msambi wa vandu mundu uyo. Akamsopa ngonji mumakutu. Kangi akahunya mata mulungoji lwaki na kumpamisa mululimi lwa mundu yula. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Kangi Yesu akalola kunani kwa Chapanga, akakeka kwa likakala, akamjovela, “Efata,” Mana yaki “Dindukayi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Lukumbi lulalula akatumbula kuyuwana bwina, mewawa lulimi lwaki lukajova bwina. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu akavalagiza vakotoka kumjovela mundu lijambu lila. Nambu cheayonjokisi kuvabesa, ndi chevadandisi malovi gala. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Vandu vakangisi neju, vakajova, “Avakitili goha gabwina hati vangayuwa kuyuwana, na vangajova kujova!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ilisa vandu elufu mcheche</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matei 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo, msambi uvaha wa vandu wakonganiki kavili hinu vavi lepi na chakulya, na Yesu avakemili vawuliwa vaki, akavajovela, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nikuvahengela lipyana vandu venava muni vatamii na nene mu ligono la datu, nambu vavi lepi na chakulya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ngati nikavajovela vawuya kunyumba na njala yati vihinduka munjila, muni vangi vahumili kutali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Vawuliwa vaki vakamkota, “Penapa palugangatu yati tipata koki mabumunda ga kuvayukutisa vandu voha ava?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu akavakota, “Muvi na mabumunda galinga?” Vakamyangula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">“Gavii saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Hinu, akavalagiza vandu vatama pahi. Akagatola mabumunda gala saba, akamsengusa Chapanga, akayimetula, akavapela vawuliwa vaki vavagavanisilayi vandu, navene vakavagavila. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Vavi mewa na somba zidebedebe. Yesu akayimotisa, mewawa akalagazila vawuliwa vaki vavagavila vandu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Vandu valili na kuyukuta. Kangi vawuliwa vakanonga masigalilu na kumemesa madengu saba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Vandu vevalili vavi ngati elufu mcheche. Yesu peamali kuvalaga, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Bahapo Yesu akayingila muwatu pamonga na vawuliwa vaki, vakahamba kumulima wa Dalimanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vafalisayu vigana ulangisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matei 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Vafalisayu vangi vakambwela na kutumbula kujovesana na Yesu. Vamlingili, vamganayi avalangisa ulangisu kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, kulangisa kuvya uhotola waki uhumili kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Nambu Yesu mtima wamvinili neju na akajova, “Ndava kyani vandu va chiveleku ichi vigana ulangisu? Chakaka nikuvajovela, vandu va chiveleku ichi vipewa lepi ulangisu!”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Kangi akavaleka akayingila kavili muwatu, akakupuka kuhamba kumwambu ya nyanja.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngemeku ya Vafalisayu na Helodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matei 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Vawuliwa vakosiwi kutola mabumunda yamahele, ndi vavi na libumunda limonga ndu muwatu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu akavalagiza, “Mlola neju! Mjiyangalila na ngemeku ya Vafalisayu na ngemeku ya Helodi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Vawuliwa vakatumbula kukotana vene kwa vene, “Ijova chenichi ndava tangali mabumunda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu agamanyili gala gevajovisini akavajovela, “Ndava kyani mkotana ndava ya mabumunda? Wu, mwakona mwangamanya amala mwangalola? Wu, ndava kyani mwiholalela lepi? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Muna mihu nambu mwilola lepi? Muvi na makutu nambu mwiyuwana lepi? Wu, mukosiwi <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />lukumbi lula panakametwili mabumunda mhanu na kuvapela vandu elufu mhanu mwamemisi masigalilu madengu galinga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Vakamyangula, “Madengu kumi na gavili.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Akavakota kavili, “Na panametwili mabumunda saba na kuvapela vandu elufu mcheche mwamemisi masigalilu madengu galinga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Vene vakamyangula, “Madengu saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Hinu, akavajovela, “Pamonga na ago, wu, mwakona mwangamanya?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu ngalola ku Betisaida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu ahikili ku Betisaida pamonga na vawuliwa vaki. Kwenuko vandu vakamletela ngalola, vakamuyupa ampamisa muni amlamisa. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu amkamwili chiwoko ngalola yula, ampeliki kuvala ya chijiji. Akamhunyila mata mumihu, akampamisa mawoko, akamkota “Wu, wihotola kulola chindu?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ngalola yula akalola, akajova “Nikuvalola vandu vevilolekana ngati mikongo yeyigenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Kangi Yesu akampamisa kavili mawoko mumihu, mwene akamuhutusila mihu, uhotola waki wa kulola ukamuwuyila namwene akalola. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu akamjovela awuya kunyumba yaki na kumlagiza “Ukotoka kuwuya ku Betisaida.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili ijova hotohoto kuvya Yesu ndi Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matei 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Kangi Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vahambili kuvijiji vya pandu ku Kaisalia Filipi. Pevavi munjila, Yesu akavakota vawuliwa vaki, “Vandu vijova nene ndi nayani?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Vakamyangula, “Vangi vijova veve ndi Yohani Mbatizaji na vangi vijova veve ndi Eliya na vangi vijova veve ndi mmonga wa Valota va Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Kangi Yesu akavakota, “Na nyenye mwijova nene kuvya ndi yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petili akamyangula, “Veve ndi Kilisitu, mweuhaguliwi na Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Kangi Yesu akavalagiza vakotoka kumjovela mundu yeyoha kuvya mwene ndi Kilisitu.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilotela ndava mang'ahiso kufwa na kuyuka kwaki.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matei 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Kangi Yesu atumbwili kuvawula vawuliwa vaki, kuvya yikumgana “Mwana wa Mundu kung'ahika na kubelelewa na vagogo na vakulu va kuteta na Vawula va Malagizu. Kangi yati ikomiwa, nambu pa ligono la datu yati iyuka.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesu avajovili lijambu lenilo hotohoto. Penapo, Petili akamtola pamuhana akatumbula akamhakalila akotoka kujova mambu ago. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Nambu Yesu akang'anamuka akavalolokesa vawuliwa vaki, akamhakalila Petili, akamjovela, “Setani, wuka palongolo yangu! Maholo gaku gihuma lepi kwa Chapanga, nambu ga umundu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Kangi Yesu akaukemela msambi wa vandu na vawuliwa vaki akavajovela, “Ngati mundu yeyoha igana kunilanda nene yikumgana ajibela mwene na agega msalaba waki anilandayi. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ndava mundu mweigana kusangula wumi waki, yati akuuyagisa, nambu mundu mweakuuyagisa wumi waki ndava ya nene na ndava ya Linenu la Bwina, yati akuusangula. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Wu, chiyonjokeseka kyani mundu kupata mulima woha na kuuyagisa fwasi ya kuyingila muwumi wa magono goha? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Mundu yati iwusa chindu kiki muni apatayi wumi wa magono goha? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ngati mundu yeyoha muvandu va chiveleku ichi chihakau na chechimbudili Chapanga ngati ikola soni kwa nene na malovi gangu, Mwana wa Mundu yati akumulolela soni mundu mwenuyo, lukumbi peibwela muukulu wa Dadi waki pamonga na vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga vamsopi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu akayendelela kuvajovela, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, vavi vandu vangi penapo yati vifwa lepi changamlola Chapanga ilongosa kwa makakala munjila ndalindali.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pamihu pa Yesu ping'anamuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matei 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Pegamaliki magono sita, Yesu avatolili Petili na Yakobo na Yohani vene ndu kuhamba kunani ya chitumbi. Kwenuko Yesu ndi agewiki pamihu palongolo yavi. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Nyula zaki yang'asimi yikavya yamsopi pehe, avi lepi mchapa nyula yeyoha pamulima mweihotola kuganyambisa ngati ago. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Kangi vawuliwa vadatu vala vavawene Eliya na Musa vilongela na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petili akamjovela Yesu, “Muwula wangu, chabwina tete kuvya bahapa. Mbanga tete tijenge vindanda vidatu. Chimonga cha veve na chingi cha Musa na chingi cha Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Amanyili lepi chakujova, ndava mwene na vayaki wogohi wavayingili.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Kangi likahumila lihundi likavagubika, na lwami lukayuwanika kuhuma mulihundi mula, “Mwenuyu ndi Mwana mwenimganili, mumyuwanila.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Bahapo vawuliwa vala vakalola kuni na kuni, nambu vamuwene lepi mundu yeyoha, nga Yesu pamonga na vene.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Hinu, pavahelelayi kuchitumbi, Yesu akavabesa vakotoka kumjovela mundu mambu gevagaweni mbaka Mwana wa Mundu peiyuka.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Vakakamula malagizu gala, nambu vakatumbula kukotana vene kwa vene, “Kuyuka mana yaki kyani?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Kangi vakamkota Yesu, “Ndava kyani Vawula va Malagizu vijova yiganikiwa hoti Eliya abwela?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Mwene akavayangula, “Ena, Eliya ibwela hoti kutendelekela kila chindu. Pamonga na ago, ndava kyani yiyandikiwi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi kuvya Mwana wa Mundu gakumkolela mang'ahiso neju na kuveveswa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Nambu nikuvajovela, Eliya amali kubwela, na vene vakamkitili chavaganili ngati Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova kumvala mwene.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa msongolo mweavi na mizuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Matei 17:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Lukumbi Yesu na vawuliwa vadatu pavawuyili pandu pevavi vawuliwa vangi vala. Vauweni msambi uvaha wa vandu pamonga na Vawula va Malagizu vijovesana. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Bahapo msambi wa vandu pawamuweni Yesu, vakakangasa neju, vakamjumbalila na kumjambusa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu akavakota vawuliwa, “Mjovesana nawu kyani?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Penapo mundu mmonga mu msambi wa vandu wula akamyangula, “Muwula, nimletili mwana vangu mweavi na mzuka weumkita kuvya ngajova. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Kila peukumkamula ukumgwisa pahi na kumuhumisa lihuluhulu mumlomo, kuni iyaga minu na kuvya myumu higa yoha. Nivayupili vawuliwa vaku vauvinga mzuka wenuwo nambu vahotwili lepi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu akavajovela, “Mwe vandu va chiveleku changali sadika! Yati nitama na nyenye mbaka ndali? Nikuvasindimalila hati ndali? Mumleta kwa nene.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Vampeliki msongolo kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Kanyata mzuka wula paumuweni Yesu, wamuhindwisi mwana yula na kumgwisa pahi akabilinduka na kuhuma lihuluhulu mumlomo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu akamkota dadi wa msongolo yula, “Mambu genaga gampatili ndali?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Akamyangula, “Gatumbwili kuhuma uwana waki. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Lukumbi lungi mzuka uwu ukumgwisa pamotu na mumanji, muni umkomekesa. Hinu ngati uhotola utihengela lipyana na kutitangatila!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu akamjovela, “Ukotoka kujova, ‘Ngati nihotola?’ Mambu goha gihotoleka kwa mundu mweisadika.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Penapo dadi yula akajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Nisadika, nambu sadika yangu yidebe! Nitangatilayi, sadika yangu yiyonjokesa!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu pauweni msambi wa vandu wiyonjokeseka kanyata palongolo yaki, akauhakalila mzuka wula, “Mzuka weukumkita mwana kuvya ngayuwa na ngajova, nikulagazila muwukayi mwana uyu kotoka kumyingila kavili!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Penapo mzuka wula ukakwesa lwami, ukamgwisa mwana yula pahi na kumuwuka. Mwana awonikini ngati mtuhi, ndi vangi vakajova, “Afwili!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Nambu Yesu akamkamula chiwoko, akamyinula namwene akayima.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Hinu Yesu peayingili mu nyumba, vawuliwa vaki vakamkota pachiepela, “Ndava kyani tete tahotwili lepi kuvinga mzuka wula?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Mwene akavajovela, “Mzuka ngati wenuwu uhotoleka lepi kuwusiwa ndu, nambu kwa njila ya kumuyupa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ijova kangi ndava ya kufwa kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matei 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vakawuka penapo na kuyendelela na lugendu lwavi kuvedukila mulima wa ku Galilaya. Yesu aganili lepi mundu yeyoha amanyayi kweavili, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />ndava muni avawulayi vawuliwa vaki. Avajovili, “Mwana wa Mundu yati igotolewa kwa vandu vevakumkoma, nambu pa ligono la datu yati iyuka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Nambu vawuliwa vamanyili lepi mana ya mawuliwu gala. Ndi vakayogopa kumkota.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mweigana kuvya mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matei 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Hinu, vakahika muji wa Kapelanaumu na kuyingila mu nyumba, Yesu akavakota vawuliwa vaki, “Mwajovisini kyani munjila?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Nambu vene vakaguna, muni munjila vakalikotana yani mweavi mkulu pagati yavi.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu akatama pahi na kuvakemela vawuliwa kumi na vavili vala, akavajovela, “Mundu akagana kuvya mkulu ndi yikumgana avyai mdebe kavili avyai mtumisi wa voha.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Ndi akamtola mwana mdebe akamyimika pagati yavi akamkumbatila kangi akavajovela, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Mweakumpokela mwana ngati uyu ndava ya nene, akunipokela nene, na mweakunipokela nene, akunipokela lepi namwene ndu, nambu akumpokela mewa na yula mweanitumili.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mweangapingana na tete avi upandi witu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohani akamjovela Yesu, “Muwula, tamuweni mundu mmonga ivinga mizuka kwa kuhengela liina lako, tikambesa, muni lepi wa chikundi chitu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Mkoto kulinga kumbesa, ndava avi lepi mundu mweihenga gachinamtiti kwa liina langu, na bahapo akatumbula kunilongalela gahakau.” <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Ndava mundu mweangapingana na tete avili upandi witu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, mundu yeyoha mweakuvapela nyenye chikombi cha manji ga kunywa, ndava nyenye vandu va Kilisitu, chakaka yati ipata njombi yaki.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gegiyokisa kumbudila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matei 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Ngati mundu yeyoha akumyokesa mmonga wa vadebe ava kuyagisa sadika yaki, ndi mbanga mundu mwenuyo kukungiwa liganga livaha la kuyagila musingu yaki na kutagiwa munyanja kuliku kuhamuliwa na Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Na chiwoko chaku ngati chikubudisa sadika yaku, chidumula! Mbanga kuyingila muwumi changali chiwoko chimonga, kuliku kuvya na mawoko gavili, na kuyingila, kumotu wangajimika magono goha. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Hinu mwenumo masomi gifwa lepi, wala motu waki wijimika lepi. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Na chigendelu chaku ngati chikakubudisai, chidumula! Mbanga kuyingila muwumi changali chigendelu chimonga kuliku kuvya na magendelu goha gavili na kutagiwa kumotu wangajimika magono goha. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Mwenumo masomi gifwa lepi na motu waki wijimika lepi. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Na lihu lako likayagisa sadika yaku litupulai! Ulitaga, mbanga kuyingila Muunkosi wa Chapanga na lihu limonga kuliku kuvya na mihu gavili na kutagiwa kumotu wangajimika wa magono goha. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Mwenumo, masomi gaki gifwa lepi na motu waki wijimika lepi.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Muni kila mundu yati inyambiswa kwa motu ngati luteta cheyinyambiswa kwa mwinyu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Mwinyu wabwina, nambu ngati iyagisi lunyong'onyo lwaki, yati iyonjokeswa na kyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Muvya na mwinyu wa unkozi mugati yinu na kusindimalisa na uteke pagati yinu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu iwula ndava ya kugegana na kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matei 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu awukili penapo akahamba kumuji wa Yudea, kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani. Msambi wa vandu wamuhambalili kavili, mwene akavawula ngati chayavili mvelu waki.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Vafalisayu vangi vamhambalili vakamkota chakumlinga, “Wu, Malagizu ga Chapanga giyidakila mgosi kumleka mdala waki?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu akavayangula, “Musa avalagizi kyani?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Vene vakajova, “Musa atiyidakili kuvya mgosi ihotola kumpela mdala waki balua na kumleka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Musa ayidikili kuvayandikila Mihilu yeniyi, ndava ya unonopa neju wa kuwuliwa kwinu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Nambu Musa ayandiki kutumbula kuwumbwa kwa mulima, Chapanga awumbili mgosi na mdala. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Ndava yeniyo mgosi yati akumleka dadi na nyina waki, yati iwungana na mdala waki, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />navene vavili yati vivya higa yimonga. Hinu vene vavili lepi kavili, nambu higa yimonga. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Hinu, mundu akotoka kuchilekanesa chila cheachiwunganisi Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Pevayingili kavili mu nyumba, vawuliwa vaki vakamkota ndava ya lijambu lenilo. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Mwene akavajovela, “Mundu yeyoha mweakumleka mdala waki na kugega mdala yungi akumkitila ugoni. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Mewawa na mdala mweakumleka mngwana waki na kugegewa na mgosi yungi ikita ugoni.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvamotisa vana vadebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matei 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Vandu vamletili Yesu vana vadebe avapamisa, nambu vawuliwa vaki vakavahakalila vandu vala. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu paalolili genago akayoma akavajovela, “Mvaleka vana ava vabwela kwangu, mkotoka kuvabesa, muni Unkosi wa Chapanga ndi wa vandu ngati ava. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, mundu yeyoha mweangaupokela Ulongosi wa Chapanga ngati mwana mdebe katu iyingila lepi mwenumo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Kangi akavapokela vana vala akavavikila mawoko panani yavi, kuvamotisa.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mweavili na vindu vyamahele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matei 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu paatumbwili lugendu, mundu mmonga ambwelili, akamfugamila na kumkota, “Muwula mbwina, nikita wuli muni nipokela wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu akamyangula, “Ndava kyani ukunikemela mbwina? Avi lepi mweavili mbwina ndi Chapanga ndu. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Uzimanyili ‘Amuli, ukotoka kukita ugoni na ukoto kukoma na ukoto kuyiva na ukoto kumjovela muyaku gaudesi na ukoto kukonga na vatopesa dadi waku na nyina waku.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Mwene akamyangula, “Muwula, genago goha nigakamwili kutumbula muusongolo wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu akamlolakesa cha uganu, akamjovela, “Upungukiwi na chindu chimonga. Hamba ukagulisa kila chindu cheuvili nachu, uvapela vangangu mashonga ago, ndi veve yati ukujivikila vindu vyaku kunani kwa Chapanga. Kangi ubwela unilandayi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Mundu yula peayuwini genago, akavya ngolongondi akahamba kuni akwinyini pamihu muni avili na vindu vyamahele na aganili lepi kuwusa vindu vyaki.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu akalola pandi zoha akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Chakaka yihotoleka lepi kwa vandu vana vindu vyamahele kumlekela Chapanga alongosa wumi wavi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Vawuliwa vakakangasa ndava ya malovi gala. Nambu Yesu akavajovela kavili, “Vana vangu mlola cheyinonopa neju kumlekela Chapanga alongosa wumi wavi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Yihotoleka kuchikita chinyama chechikemiwa ngamiya kuholota mulibowo la sindanu, mewawa yilolekana, yati yinonopa neju kwa mundu mweavi na vindu vyamahele kumlekela Chapanga alongosa wumi waki!”<figure style="fig" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" ref="10:25">Chinyama chechikemiwa Ngamiya</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Vawuliwa vaki vakayendelela kukangasa neju, hati vakakotana vene kwa vene, “Yani hinu mweihotola kusanguliwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu akavalola, akavajovela, “Kwa vandu yihotoleka lepi, nambu kwa Chapanga chenicho lepi. Kwa Chapanga kila chindu chihotoleka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Kangi Petili akajova, “Lola! Tete talekili vindu vyoha, tikukulanda!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu akayangula, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, mundu yeyoha mweailekili nyumba amala valongo amala valumbu amala mau amala dadi amala vana na migunda ndava yangu na ndava ya Linenu la Bwina, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />yati ipokela mala miya ng'onyo mulukumbi lwa hinu. Yati ipokela nyumba na valongo na vahaja na valumbu na mau, pamonga na mang'ahiso. Na palukumbi lwelubwela yati ipokela wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Nambu vamahele vevavi vakulu hinu yati vivya vadebe na vamahele vevavi vadebe hinu yati vivya vakulu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ijova mala ya datu kufwa na kuyuka kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matei 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vavi mulugendu kuhamba ku Yelusalemu, mwene avalongolili. Vawuliwa vaki vakakangasa na vandu vevavalandayi vakavya na wogohi. Yesu akavatola kavili kuchiyepela vawuliwa kumi ni vavili, akatumbula kuvajovela gala gegakumkolela. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Akavajovela, “Muyuwanila! Tihamba ku Yelusalemu. Kwenuko Mwana wa Mundu yati vakumgotola mu mawoko ga vakulu va kuteta na Vawula va Malagizu, navene yati vakamhamula akomiwa na kumgotola kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />vene yati vakumvevesa, vakumuhunyila mata, yati vakumtova michapilu na kumkoma. Nambu pa ligono la datu yati iyuka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luyupu lwa Yakobo na Yohani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matei 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Yakobo na Yohani, vana va Zebedayo, vamuhambalili Yesu vakamjovela, “Muwula, tigana utihengela chindu chetikuyupa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu akavakota, “Mwigana nivahengela kyani?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Vene vakamyangula, “Pewilongosa muukulu waku, utiyidakila kutama mmonga upandi waku wa kulyelela na yungi upandi waku wa kumangeya.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu akavajovela, “Mumanyi lepi chemwiyupa! Wu, yati mwihotola kunywelela chikombi cha mang'ahiso cheninywelela? Amala ubatizu ngati wenibatiziwi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Vakamyangula, “Tihotola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yesu akavajovela, “Chikombi cha mang'ahiso cheninywelela chakaka yati mwinywelela na kavili yati mbatiziwa ngati chenibatiziwi. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Nambu uhotola wa kuhagula yani atama upandi wa kulyela amala kumangeya. Chapanga alavapela fwasi zenizo vala voha veavatendelekili.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Vawuliwa vangi kumi vala pevayuwini ago, vakavayomela vayavi Yakobo na Yohani. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Hinu Yesu akavakemela, akavajovela, “Mumanyili kuvya vala veviholalewa kuvya vakulu va milima vakuvalongosa vandu vavi kwa makakala na vakulu venavo vakuvatalalila vandu vavi. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Nambu kwinu yikoto kuvya chenichi, yula mweigana kuvya mkulu pagati yinu yikumgana avya mtumisi winu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Mweigana kuvya mkulu kuliku voha, yikumgana avya mvanda wa voha. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Hati Mwana wa Mundu abwelili lepi kuhengewa nambu kuvahengela na kuwusa wumi waki uvya luhuna ndava ya kuvagombola vandu vamahele.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu mmonga ngalola mweikemiwa Batimayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matei 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Vakahamba mbaka ku Yeliko. Yesu paawukayi pamuji wenuwo pamonga na vawuliwa vaki na msambi uvaha wa vandu. Ngalola mmonga mwana wa Timayo mweikemelewa Batimayo, atamili pamuhana ya njila, iyupa yala. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Peayuwini kuvya Yesu wa ku Nazaleti ipita pandu pala, akatumbula kukwesa lwami, “Yesu, Mwana wa Daudi, unihengela lipyana!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Vandu vamahele vakamlakali kumgunisa, nambu mwene akayonjokesa kukwesa lwami, “Mwana wa Daudi, unihengela lipyana!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu akayima, akajova, “Mumkemela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Hinu vakamkemela ngalola yula, vakamjovela, “Jipolesa mtima! Yima, akukemela.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Batimayo akataga likoti laki, akahumba kanyata na kumhambila Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu akamkota, “Ugana nikukitila kyani?” Ngalola yula akamyangula, “Muwula, niyupa kulola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu akamjovela, “Hamba, sadika yaku yikulamisi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Bahapo ngalola yula akahotola kulola, akalongosana na Yesu munjila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu iyingila ku Yelusalemu kwa chilulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matei 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohani 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki pavavi papipi na Yelusalemu muji wa Betifage na Betania, papipi na Chitumbi cha Mizeituni. Penapo avatumili vawuliwa vaki vavili, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />akavajovela, “Muhamba kuchijiji chechivii palongolo yinu. Pemuyingila penapo yati mkumkolela mwanapunda akungiwi, na akona angahengewa na mundu. Mumuwopola mkamleta. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ngati mundu akuvakota, ‘Ndava kyani muwopola lipunda?’ Mumjovela, ‘Bambu akumgana na yati akumuwuyisa mwanakandahi.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Hinu, vakahamba, vakamkolela mwanapunda akungiwi kuvala ya mlyangu wa nyumba yeyavi pamuhana ya njila. Pevamuwopolayi, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />vandu vangi vevayimili penapo vakavakota, “Ndava kyani muwopola mwanapunda?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Vawuliwa vakavayangula ngati Yesu cheavalagizi na vene vakavaleka vahamba nayu. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Vamletili Yesu mwanapunda. Pavamalili kuyambatisa nyula yavi panani ya mwanapunda yula. Yesu akatama panani yaki. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Vandu vamahele vakadandasa nyula zavi munjila kwa kumtopesa, na vangi vakadandasa matutu gadebe gadebe gavadumwili mumigunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Vandu voha vevalongolili na vala vevalandayi, vakakwesa lwami lwavi vakajova, “Alumbiwa! Amotisiwa mweibwela kwa liina la Bambu! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Umotisiwa unkosi weubwela wa dadi witu Daudi. Chapanga alumbiwa mweavi kunani!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu ayingili pamuji wa Yelusalemu akahamba mbaka mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, akalola vindu vyoha kwa ubwina. Nambu yamali kuvya chitita akahamba ku Betania pamonga na vawuliwa vaki kumi na vavili vala.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuupela likoto mkongo wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matei 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Chilau yaki, pavahumili ku Betania, Yesu njala yamvinili. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Hinu auweni mkongo wa mtini chakutali wewavi na mahamba gamahele. Hinu akauhambila aganayi alolayi ngati upambiki matunda. Nambu peahikili, nakugakolela matunda ndi mahamba gene, muni yavi lepi lusenje lwa kupambika matunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Penapo akaujovela mkongo wula, “Kutumbula lelu na magono goha mundu yeyoha akotoka kulya matunda gaku!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Na vawuliwa vaki vagayuwini malovi genago.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iyingila mu Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matei 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohani 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Hinu vahikili ku Yelusalemu, Yesu ayingili mu Nyumba ya Chapanga na kutumbula kuvavinga vandu vevagulisai na kugula vindu mwenumo. Azing'anambwisi meza za vala vevagulisana mashonga, na vigoda vya vandu vevagulisa ngunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Amyidakili lepi mundu yeyoha kuvedukila mu Nyumba ya Chapanga kuni agegili chindu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Kangi akavawula, “Yiyandikwi, ‘Nyumba yangu yati yivya msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu ndava ya vandu milima yoha!’ Nambu nyenye mukuikita libokosela la vanyagaji!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Vakulu va kuteta na Vawula va Malagizu pevayuwini malovi gala, vakatumbula kulonda njila ya kumkoma. Nambu vayogwipi ndava msambi wa vandu wakangiswi mawuliwu gaki.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Kimihi payahikili, Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vakawuka pamuji wula.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liwulo ndava ya mkongo weunyalili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matei 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Lukela pavapitayi, vauweni mkongo wa mkuyu wula uyumili hotohoto, kuhuma mumikiga mbaka kunani. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petili alikumbwiki lijambu lila, akamjovela Yesu, “Muwula, lolayi! Mkongo wa mtini wewaupelili likoto ula uyumili!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu akavajovela, “Mumsadika Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Nikuvajovela chakaka, mundu akachijovela chitumbi, ‘Tupukayi ukajitaga munyanja,’ Changali kuvya na wogoyi mumtima waki, nambu ngati isadika mambu goha gihengeka yati ihengewa lijambu lenilo. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ndava yeniyo nikuvajovela, pemukumuyupa Chapanga na kuyupa chindu, musadika kuvya mpokili, na nyenye yati mwipewa. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Pamwiyima kumuyupa Chapanga, mumlekekesa mundu yeyoha mweavakitili gahakau, ndi Dadi winu wa kunani avalekekesa nyenye mabudilu ginu. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Nambu ngati mukuvalekekesa lepi vangi, mewawa na Dadi winu mweavili kunani kwaki akuvalekekesa lepi nyenye mabudilu ginu.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likotesi ndava ya uhotola wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matei 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Hinu, vahikili kavili ku Yelusalemu. Yesu paagendayi pa Nyumba ya Chapanga, vakulu va kuteta na Vawula va Malagizu na vagogo vamuhambalili, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />vakamkota, “Ukita mambu genaga kwa uhotola wa yani? Yani mweakupelili uhotola wa kukita mambu genago?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Yati nikuvakota lijambu limonga. Mukaniyangula, na nene mewa yati nikuvajovela nikita mambu aga kwa uhotola wa Yani. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Wu, Yohani apatili uhotola wa kubatiza kuhuma kwa Chapanga amala kwa vandu? Munijovela.”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Vakatumbula kukotana, “Tikayangula, ‘Gahumili kwa Chapanga,’ Yati akutikota, ndava kyani mwasadiki lepi? <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Na tikayangula, ‘Gahumili kwa vandu,’ Yati yivya wuli?” Vayogwipi vandu, ndava vandu voha wamyidakili kuvya chakaka Yohani avi mlota wa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Hinu vakamyangula Yesu, “Tete timanyili lepi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Na Yesu akavajovela, “Na nene mewa nikuvajovela lepi nikita mambu aga kwa uhotola wa yani.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mgunda wa mizabibu na valimaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matei 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu akatumbula kulongela nawu, kwa luhumu akajova, mundu mmonga alimili mgunda wa mizabibu, Atindisili luwumba, na pagati yaki agimili ligodi la kuminyila divayi ajengili mnala, akalikodisha kwa valimaji, akahamba mulima wa kutali.<figure style="fig" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" ref="12:1">Vandu vavili viminya zabibu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Lusenje lwa mabenu, amtumili mvanda waki kwa valimaji vala, akamletela pandu paki pa mabenu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Nambu valimaji vala, vakamkamula mvanda yula, vakamtova vakamuwuyisa mawoko gawaka. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Mkolo mgunda amtumili kavili mvanda yungi. Mewa mwenuyo vakamulemasa kumutu na kumkitila mambu ga soni. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Mewawa, mkolo mgunda yula akamtuma mvanda yungi, mwenuyo vakamkoma. Vangi vamahele veavatumili, vangi pagati yavi vatoviwi na vangi vakomiwi. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Asigalili mundu mmonga, ndi mwana waki chiganu. Pamwishu amtumili mwenuyo akajova, nimanyili yati vakumtopesa mwana vangu. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />“Nambu valimaji vala pavamuwene ibwela, vakajovesana, ‘Mwenuyu ndi mhali, ndi timkomayi muni uhali waki uvyai witu!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Hinu vakamkamula, vakamkoma na kumtaga kuvala ya mgunda wa mizabibu wula.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Akavakota, hinu mkolo mgunda yati ikita kyani? Yati ibwela kuvakoma valimaji vala na kuvapela mgunda wa mizabibu wula vandu vangi.” <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Wu, mwangasoma Mayandiku Gamsopi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">Liganga levalibelili vakujenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">hinu ndi liganga lelikamulila nyumba.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Bambu ndi mweakitili lijambu lenili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">lenili ndi lachinamtiti neju kwitu!<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Vachilongosi va Vayawudi na Vawula va Malagizu na vagogo, vamanyili kuvya luhumu wenuwo ukuvavala vene. Vaganili kumkamula, nambu vayogwipi msambi wa vandu. Vakamleka vakawuka.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lijambu la kulipa kodi kwa Nkosi wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matei 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Vangi pagati ya Vafalisayu na valanda va chikundi cha Helodi vatumwili vamyonjola Yesu kwa malovi gaki. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Vamhambili, vakamjovela, “Muwula, timanyili kuvya veve wamundu wa chakaka mweujova chakaka. Veve ukumlola lepi mundu mwene ndi yani, ukulu wa mundu chindu lepi kwa veve, nambu wiwula chakaka munjila ya Chapanga. Wu, chabwina kulipa kodi kwa nkosi wa ku Loma amala lepi? Tilipayi amala tikotoka kulipa?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Nambu Yesu amanyili uhomela wavi, akavajovela, “Ndava kyani mukunilinga? Muniletelayi lishonga lene nililolayi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Vakampela lishonga lila, na mwene akavakota, “Pamihu na liina la yani?” Vakamyangula, “Vya nkosi wa ku Loma.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Hinu Yesu akavajovela, “Mumpelayi nkosi wa ku Loma vyevivili vyaki na mumpelayi Chapanga vyevivii vyaki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Vakakangaswa nayu neju.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lijambu la kuyuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matei 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Kangi Vasadukayu vevijova kawaka kuyuka vamuhambalili Yesu vakamkota, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Muwula, Musa atilagazili, mundu akafwayi na kuleka mdala changali mwana mlongo vaki yikumgana amuhala lipwela yula, ndi ambabakisila vana mlongo vaki. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Leka tijova pavi na valongo saba. Mwealongolili kuvelekewa agegili afwili changaleka mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Mbena waki akamuhala lipwela yula, namwene afwili changaleka mwana, yikavya mewawa na mlongo wa datu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Voha saba vafwili changaleka mwana. Kangi lipwela yula afwili. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Hinu ligono vandu paviyuka, mau yula yati ivya mdala wa yani? Ndava voha saba vamgegili.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu akavayangula, nyenye mbudili ndava mmanyi lepi Mayandiku Gamsopi amala makakala ga Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Muni vevafwili peviyuka yati vigega lepi amala kugegewa, yati vivya ngati vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Nambu ndava ya kuyuka kwa vevafwili, msomili lepi chitabu cha Musa pandu pepivala dasi yeyiyaka motu? Chapanga amjovili Musa, nene ndi Chapanga wa Ibulahimu na Chapanga wa Izaki na Chapanga wa Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Hinu, mwene lepi “Chapanga wa vevafwili, nambu Chapanga wa vevavi wumi. Nyenye mbudili neju!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhilu ukulu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matei 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Mmonga wa vawula va malagizu abwelili na kayuwana mhutanu wavi. Peaweni Yesu akuvayangula bwina, akamhegelela na kumkota Yesu, “Pagati ya malagizu goha yoki yikulu?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu akamyangula, “Malagizu gakulu pagati ya goha ndi aga: ‘Myuwanila nyenye vandu wa ku Isilaeli! Bambu Chapanga witu, ngamwene Bambu. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Umgana Bambu Chapanga waku kwa wumi waku woha na mtima waku woha na luhala lwaku lwoha, na makakala gaku goha.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Na muhilu wa pili ndi uwu: ‘Umgana muyaku ngati cheukujigana wamwene.’ Gavi lepi malagizu gakulu gangi ngati aga.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Hinu, muwula wa malagizu yula akamjovela Yesu, “Muwula! Ujovili chakaka kuvya Bambu ndi Chapanga, kawaka yungi nambu mwene. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Na yikumgana mundu kumgana Chapanga kwa mtima woha na luhala lwoha na makakala gaki goha, na kumgana muyaki ngati cheakujigana mwene. Lijambu lenili ndi labwina neju kuliku kumpela Chapanga hinyama ya kutinyisa na teta zozoha zingi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu pealoli mundu yula ayangwili kwa ukekesi, akamjovela, “Veve uvi papipi kumyidakila Chapanga atalalila wumi waku.” Kangi peamali kujova ago kawaka mundu mwealingi kumkota Yesu linenu.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisitu ndi mwana wa yani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matei 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Lukumbi Yesu iwula mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, akotili, “Ndava kyani Vawula va Malagizu vijova kuvya Kilisitu ndi mmonga ndu pagati ya vana va Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Daudi mwene kwa kulongoswa na Mpungu Msopi ajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Bambu amjovili Bambu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">tama upandi wangu wa kulyelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">mbaka nivavika vamakoko vaku pahi pa magendelu gaku.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Daudi mwene akumkemela Kilisitu ‘Bambu.’ Yihotoleka wuli hinu kuvya mmonga ndu pagati ya vana vaki?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu akuvajovela vandu vajiyangalila na vawula va malagizu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matei 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Msambi wa vandu wamuyuwanila kwa luheku. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Mukuwula kwaki, Yesu avajovili, “Mujiyangalila na Vawula va Malagizu, vevigana kugenda kuni vawalili magwanda gatali na kujambuswa na kwa utopesa vandu pandu pakugulisila vindu. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Mewawa vigana kutama palongolo munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi na mvigoda vya palongolo pamgongolelu wa chakulya. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Vene vitola nyumba na vindu vya valipwela kwa kuvakonga, kuni vakujidekesa kumuyupa Chapanga mulukumbi lutali. Ligono la mwishu yati vilipiswa pavaha.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luteta lwa lipwela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu atamili papipi na chijomela cha kusopela luteta mu Nyumba ya Chapanga. Avalolili vandu chavasopa teta muchijomela chila. Vandu vana vindu vyamahele, vasopili mashonga gamahele mugati yaki. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Kangi akabwela lipwela mngangu mmonga, akasopa sendi zivili videbe neju. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesu avakemili vawuliwa vaki akavajovela, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, lipwela uyu mngangu asopili mashonga gamahele muchijomela kuliku vangi voha. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Muni vandu voha vangi vawusili chiyonjokesu cha vindu, nambu mau uyu mngangu, asopili vindu vyoha vyeviganikwa ndava ya kulama.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ijova ndava ya kugwisiwa kwa Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matei 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu peahumayi mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, mmonga wa vawuliwa vaki amjovili, “Muwula, lola maganga na majengu aga chegavili gabwina na kukangasa!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu akamyangula, “Wu, ukugalola majengu aga zivaha? Kawaka liganga hati limonga lelisigalila panani ya liganga lingi, kila liganga yati ligwisiwa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang'ahiso na mtahu wewibwela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matei 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu paatamili panani ya chitumbi cha Mizeituni kulolokesa Nyumba ya Chapanga, Petili na Yakobo na Yohani na Andelea vakamkota pevavi ngavene, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tijovela mambu genago yati gihumila ndali? Na ulangisu woki weulangisa kuvya mambu aga gavi papipi kuhumila?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu akatumbula kuvajovela, “Mujiyangalilayi mundu akotoka kuvakonga.” <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Muni vamahele yati vibwela na kulihengela liina langu, kila mundu yati ijova kuvya mwene ndi Kilisitu! Vene yati vakuvakonga vandu vamahele. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Pemyuwana gegivala ngondo na vandu vilongelela mambu ga ngondo mkotoka kuvagaya. Yikugagana mambu genaga kuhumila, nambu mwishu wene wakona. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Vandu va mulima umonga yati utovana na vandu va mulima wungi, unkosi umonga yati utovana na unkosi wungi, yati kwiva na mindendemo ya ndima pamonga na njala. Mambu ago ndi ngati utumbula wa lipyanda la kuveleka mwana.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Nambu nyenye mjiyangalila. Muni yati vakuvatakila mumabanji ga mihalu, na kutovewa munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi. Mewawa yati vakuvapeleka palongolo ya vachilongosi na vankosi ndava ya nene, muni mujova ndava yangu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Nambu yiganikiwa hoti linenu la Bwina likokosewayi kwa vandu voha kwakona mwishu wangahika. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Na pamwikamuliwa na kupelekwa mumabanji ga mihalu, mkoto kuhololela chakujova. Lukumbi lwenulo. Nambu mjova chechoha chemwipewa kujova, muni yati gihuma kwa Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mlongo yati akumng'anamukila mhaja waki akomiwa na dadi yati akumng'anamukila mwana waki, na vana yati vakuvang'anamukila dadi na nyina vavi vakomewayi. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Vandu voha yati vakuvagana lepi ndava ya liina langu. Nambu mweisindimala mbaka mwishu ndi Chapanga akumsangula kuhuma uhamula wa magono goha gangali mwishu.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang'ahiso gakulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matei 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Pemwilola ‘Yomeso lihakau lelilangisa uhalabisu’ Liyimili pandu pangaganikiwa kuvya.” Mweisoma malovi aga amanyalila. Hinu vevavili ku Yudea na vajumbalila kuchitumbi. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Mundu mweavili kuvala ya nyumba yaku akotoka kuyingila mugati kutola chindu, nambu atilayi! <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Mewawa mundu mweavili kumgunda akotoka kuwuya kunyumba yaki kutola nyula yaki. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Niviniswa mtima ndava ya vanandumbu na vevinyong'esa magono ago, ndava yati kwivya na mang'ahiso neju. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Nambu mumuyupayi Chapanga mambu ago gakotoka kuhumila lukumbi lwa mbepu. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Muni magono ago yati kwiva na mang'ahiso gakulu, gangahumila kuhuma Chapanga kuwumba mulima mbaka lelu, katu yati gihumila lepi kavili. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ngati Bambu ngagapunguziwi lepi magono kawaka hati mundu mmonga wa kusanguliwa. Nambu ndava ya vahaguliwa vaki, Bambu agapungwizi magono ago.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Kangi, mundu akavajovela, lolayi, Kilisitu avili apa! Amala, avili pala, mkotoka kusadika. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Muni yati vihumalila vakina Kilisitu vaudesi na vamlota va udesi, yati vikita ulangisu na chinamtiti, ngati yihotoleka ndava ya kuvabudisa hati vahaguliwa va Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Nambu nyenye mujiyangalila. Nene nivajovili mambu genaga kwakona gangahumila.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matei 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Nambu pegimalika magono ago ga mang'ahiso, lilanga yati lisopewa chitita na mwehi yati ulangasa lepi. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Ndondo yati zigwa kuhuma kunani, na vindu vyoha vya kumahundi yati vinyuguswa. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Penapo yati vakumlola Mwana wa Mundu, ibwela mulihundi kwa makakala gamahele na ukulu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Ndi yati akuvatuma vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga vavalunda vandu vevahaguliwi na Chapanga, kuhuma pandi mcheche za mulima, na hati kuhuma pandu pa kutali ya mulima woha.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu kuhuma mumkongo wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matei 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Mujiwula kuhuma mumkongo wa mtini. Pemwilola mahamba gimela, nyenye mwimanya kuvya lusenje lwa fula luhegalili. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Mewawa na nyenye pemwilola mambu genago gihengeka, mmanya kuvya Mwana wa Mundu avi papipi neju kuhika. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, chiveleku ichi chipita lepi kwakona mambu aga kuhumila. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Hati ngati kunani kwa Chapanga na pamulima yati ziwuka, nambu malovi gangu yati gihumila ngati chenajovili.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawaka mweimanya ligono la mwishu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matei 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Nambu, avi lepi mundu mweimanya ligono la mwishu yati libwela ndali, hati vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga, hati Mwana wa Chapanga. Dadi Chapanga ndu mweamanyili. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mujiyangalila na mujitendekela, muni mumanyili lepi ligono amala lukumbi peluhumila. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Yati yivya ngati mundu mweahambi lugendu na kuvalekela vahengaji utalalila, kila mundu na lihengu laki, akumjovela mlonda wa mlyangu avyai mihu. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Mujitendelekela, ndava muni mmanyi lepi mkolo nyumba iwuya ndali. Pangi yivya kimihi, pagati ya kilu, hambakucha amala lukela. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Mujitendelekela, muni ngati abwelili cha kukenyemusa, akotoka kuvakolela mgonili. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Genikuvajovela nyenye, nikuvajovela mwavoha. Muvya mihu!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Vateta vakulu viyidakilana kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matei 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohani 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Gavili gakona magono gavili kuhika Mselebuko wa Pasaka na Mselebuko wa kulya mabumunda gangali ngemeku. Vakulu va kuteta na Vawula va Malagizu valondayi njila ya kumkamula Yesu cha mfiyu na kumkoma. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Nambu vakajova, “Tikotoka kukita chenicho lukumbi lwa mselebuko, ndava vandu yati vikita chitututu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mau mmonga akumnyala Yesu mahuta geginungalila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matei 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohani 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu avili ku Betania kunyumba ya Simoni mweavi na mabudi. Peavili pameza kulya chakulya, mau mmonga mweavili na kachupa kadebe kaganga ka alabasta kamahuta geginungalilayi neju, mahuta geginungalila bwina gegatenganizwi kwa nado, akabwela. Akayidindula chupa yila, na kumyitila Yesu mahuta gala kumutu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Vandu vangi vevavi penapo vayomiswi na chitendu chila vakajijovela, “Ndava kyani kuyagisa waka mahuta geginungalila bwina? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Mahuta ago ngagagulisiwi kwa mashonga gamahele, ngavapewili vangangu!” Vakamywangila mau yula.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Mumleka! Ndava ya kyani mukumung'aha? Anikitili nene lijambu labwina. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Vangangu muvinawu magono goha, muhotola kuvatangatila lukumbi lwolwoha lwa mwigana. Nambu nene yati nivya lepi na nyenye lukumbi lwoha. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Mwene akitili chaehotwili. Alongolili kuniyitila mahuta geginungalila muhiga yangu anitendelekili kwakona kuzikiwa kwangu palongolo. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, pamulima woha Linenu la Bwina yati likokoswa, chitendu ichi cheakitili yati chiluwuliwa kwa kumkumbuka mdala uyu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda iyidakila kumgotola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matei 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Kangi Yuda Isikalioti, mmonga wa vawuliwa kumi na vavili vala, akahamba kwa vakulu va kuteta ndava ya kumgotola Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Vakulu va kuteta pevayuwini malovi genago, vahekalili, vayidakilini kumpela mashonga. Ndi, Yuda akatumbula kulonda lukumbi lwa kumgotola Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilya chakulya cha Pasaka na vawuliwa vaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matei 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohani 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ligono la kutumbula kwa Mselebuko wa Mabumunda yangali ngemeku, lukumbi lwa kuhinja mwanalimbelele wa Pasaka, vawuliwa vaki vakamkota, “Ugana tikakutendelekelayi koki chakulya cha Pasaka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Hinu, Yesu avatumili vawuliwa vaki vavili akavajovela, “Muhambayi kumuji, kwenuko yati mkumkolela mgosi mmonga agegili chihulu cha manji. Mumlanda <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mbaka munyumba yeiyingila, mkamjovelayi mkolo nyumba, ‘Muwula ikota, chivi koki chumba cha vayehe penilya Pasaka pamonga na vawuliwa vangu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Mwene yati akuvalangisa chumba chivaha kunani ya kugolofa chechitendelekiwi. Mtendekelayi mwenumo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Hinu, vawuliwa vakawuka, vakahamba kumuji, vakakolela kila chindu chivi bwina ngati Yesu cheavajovili. Ndi vakatendelekela chakulya cha Pasaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Payavili kimihi, Yesu ahikili penapo pamonga na vawuliwa vaki kumi na vavili. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Pevalyayi pamonga, Yesu akajova, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, mmonga winu mweilya pamonga na nene, yati akunigotola.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Penapo vawuliwa vaki vakatumbula kuviniswa mitima, vakatumbula kumkota mmonga mmonga, “Wu, ndi nene?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu akavajovela, “Ndi mmonga winu pagati yinu nyenye kumi na vavili, mweijwiga libumunda pamonga na nene munkeve. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Chakaka Mwana wa Mundu yati ifwa ngati Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova. Nambu alachikolela mundu yula mweakumgotola Mwana wa Mundu! Mbanga kwa mundu mwenuyo ngati ngavelekiwi lepi!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulya chakulya pamonga na Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matei 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Vakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Pevalyayi, Yesu akatola libumunda, akamsengusa Chapanga, akalimetula na kuvapela vawuliwa vaki akajova, “Mtola, yeniyi, ndi higa yangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Kangi akatola chikombi cha divayi, akamsengusa Chapanga, akavapela voha vanywelili divayi muchikombi chila. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Akavajovela, “Yeniyi ndi ngasi yangu yeyilangisa lilaganu la Chapanga kwa vandu vaki, ngasi yeyiyitika ndava ya kulekekesa mabudilu ga vandu vamahele. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, ninywa lepi kavili divayi mbaka ligono lila peninywa kavili mu Unkosi wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Kangi vakayimba lunyimbu lwa kumsengusa Chapanga, vakawuka, vakahamba ku Chitumbi cha Mizeituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilota ngati Petili yati akumbela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matei 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohani 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Mwavoha nyenye yati mwitila na kunileka nene, mu Mayandiku Gamsopi Chapanga ijova, ‘Yati nikumkoma mdimaji, na mambelele yati gipechengana.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Nambu nikayukayi, yati nikuvalongolela ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petili akamjovela, “Hati ngati voha yati vakukuleka, nene katu nikukuleka lepi!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu akamjovela, “Chakaka nikujovela, kilu iyi, kwakona lijogolo langakokoleka mala zivili, yati ukunibela mala zidatu kuvya unimanyili lepi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Nambu Petili akakangamala kujova, “Hati ngati yikunigana nifwa pamonga na veve, katu yati nikukuleka lepi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Vawuliwa voha vakajova mewawa.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuyupa Chapanga kulidimba la ku Gesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matei 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Hinu, vakahika kulidimba lelikemelewa Gesemane. Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Mtama apa lukumbi penikumuyupa Chapanga.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Kangi akavatola Petili na Yakobo na Yohani. Akatumbula kuviniswa mtima na kung'ahika neju. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Akavajovela, “Niviniswa mtima neju hati papipi kufwa. Mtama na muvya mihu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Akahamba palongolo padebe akajitaga cha kukupama pahi, akamuyupa Chapanga, kuvya ngati yihotoleka, lukumbi ulo lwa mang'ahiso lumupitila kutali. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Akajova, “Dadi wangu, kwa veve mambu goha gihotoleka. Uniwusilayi chikombi ichi cha mang'ahiso. Nambu lepi ngati chenigana nene, nambu cheugana wamwene.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Kangi akawuya kwa vawuliwa vadatu vala akavakolela vagonili. Hinu, akamkota Petili, “Simoni, wu, ugonili? Uhotwi lepi kuvya mihu hati lukumbi ludebe?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Kangi akavajovela, “Muvyai mihu na kumuyupa Chapanga mkotoka kuyingila mukulingiwa. Mpungu ugana, nambu higa yitotokela.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Akahamba kumuyupa Chapanga kavili akawuyila malovi galagala. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Peavawuyili vawuliwa vaki avakolili vagonili kavili. Ndava mihu gavi na lugono. Vamanyi lepi chakumyangula.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Peabwelili mala ya datu akavajovela, “Mwakona mwigona na kupumulila? Hinu yikoli! Lukumbi luhikili! Mwana wa Mundu igotolewa kwa vandu vevambudila Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Muyimuka, tihambi. Mlolayi yula mweakunigotola ahegalili.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikamuliwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matei 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohani 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu peavi akona ijova, Yuda mmonga wa kumi na vavili vala, akabwela pamonga na msambi wa vandu wewavili na mapanga na vibonga. Vandu venavo vatumwili na vakulu va kuteta, Vawula va Malagizu na vagogo. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda, yula mweamgotwili Yesu, avapelili ulangisu msambi wa vandu wula, “Kuvya yula mwenikumjambusa cha kumkumbatila, ndi mumkamula na mumpeleka kuni avi muulonda.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yuda peahikili ndu amuhambalili Yesu akamjovela, “Muwula!” Kangi akamjambusa cha kumkumbatila. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Hinu vandu vala vakamkamula Yesu na kumkunga. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Mmonga mweayimili pamonga na Yesu, akaholomola upanga waki, akamdumula likutu mvanda wa Mteta Mkulu. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu akamjovela, “Wu, mbwelili na mapanga na vibonga kunikamula ngati kuvya nene mnyagaji? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Magono goha navi pamonga na nyenye, niwula ku Nyumba ya Chapanga, nambu mwanikamwili lepi. Nambu hinu yikugagana Mayandiku Gamsopi gatimilayi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Penapo vawuliwa voha vakamleka na kutila.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Kwavili na msongolo mmonga mweamlandayi Yesu awalili chikwinda. Vene valingili kumkamula. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Nambu mwene akalema, akachileka chikwinda chila, akajumba waka.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu palongolo ya libanji la vagogo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matei 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohani 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Hinu, vampeliki Yesu kunyumba ya Mteta Mkulu, penapo ndi pevakonganiki pamonga vakulu va kuteta voha na vagogo na Vawula va Malagizu. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petili amlandili Yesu chapatali, akayingila muluvanja lwa nyumba ya Mteta Mkulu. Akatama pamonga na valonda kuyota motu. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Vakulu va kuteta na libanji loha valondai linenu la kumtakila Yesu muni vahotola kumkoma, nambu valipati lepi. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Vandu vamahele vajovili gaudesi ndava ya Yesu, nambu malovi gavi gayidakilini lepi.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Kangi vandu vangi vakayima kujova udesi ndava ya Yesu, vakajova, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Tete tamuyuwini ijova, ‘Nene yati nigwisa Nyumba ya Chapanga iyi yeyijengiwi na vandu, na mu magono gadatu yati nijenga yingi yangajengewa na vandu.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Nambu pamonga na ago, malovi gavi gayidikilini lepi.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Hinu, Mteta Mkulu akayima pagati yavi akamkota Yesu, “Wu, wiyangula lepi linenu, vandu venava vakukutakila kyani?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Nambu mwene agunili, ajovili lepi linenu hati limonga. Mkulu wa kuteta akamkota kavili, “Veve ndi Kilisitu, Mwana wa Chapanga Mmotisa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu akayangula, “Ena, ndi nene. Kavili yati mukumlola Mwana wa Mundu atamili upandi wa kulyelela cha Bambu yula mweavi na makakala. Ibwela kuhumila mumahundi ga kunani kwa Chapanga!”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Penapo ndi Mteta Mkulu akapapula nyula zaki, akajova, “Tigana lepi kuyuwana malovi gangi ndava ya mundu uyu! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mumyuwini cheakumliga Chapanga! Nyenye mjova wuli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Voha vamganili akomiwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Hinu, vangi pagati yavi vakatumbula kumuhunyila mata, vakamgubika pamihu vakamtova na kumjovela, “Lotelayi, ndi yani mweakutovili!” Hati valonda vakamtola, vakampamanda.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumbela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matei 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohani 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petili peavi akona muluvanja lwa nyumba, mtumisi mmonga wa chidala wa Mteta Mkulu abwelili. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Peamuweni Petili iyota motu, amlolili, akamjovela, “Hati veve wavili pamonga na Yesu wa ku Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Nambu Petili akabela, “Kwali, nakuchimanya cheujova!” Petili akawuka akahamba pamlyangu wa kuyingilila. Penapo ndi lijogolo likakokoleka.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Muhengaji mdala yula, peamuwene kavili Petili, akatumbula kangi kuvajovela vandu vevavi penapo, “Mundu uyu ndi mmonga wavi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Nambu Petili akabela kavili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Mwanakandahi, vandu vevayimili penapo vamjovili Petili, “Chakaka veve ndi mmonga wavi, muni veve mewawa ndi mundu wa ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Nambu Petili akatumbula kujova, “Nipewa likoto ngati nijova udesi! Nilapa nimmanyili lepi mundu uyu mwemukumuluwula.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Bahapo lijogolo likakokoleka mala ya pavili. Petili akumbwiki Yesu cheamjovili, “Kwakona lijogolo langakokoleka yati ukunibela mala zidatu.” Petili akajitaga pahi na kuvemba.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu palongolo ya Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matei 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohani 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Lukela pehe, vakulu va kuteta vayidakilini pamonga na vagogo na Vawula va Malagizu na vanalibanji voha, vakamkunga Yesu, vakampeleka na kumgotola kwa Pilatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilatu akamkota Yesu, “Wu, veve ndi Nkosi wa Vayawudi?” Yesu akayangula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">“Ena, ndi ngati wamwene cheujova.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Vakulu va kuteta vamtakili Yesu mambu gamahele. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Hinu, Pilatu akamkota kavili Yesu, “Wu, wiyangula lepi linenu? Yuwanila chevakutakila mambu gamahele kukuvala veve.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Nambu Yesu ayangwili lepi linenu, hati Pilatu akakangasa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihamuliwa akomiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matei 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohani 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kila lukumbi lwa mselebuko wa Pasaka, Pilatu avi na mvelu wa kuvadindulila vandu mkungiwa mmonga mwevamganayi. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Lukumbi lwenulo kwavili mundu mmonga liina laki Balaba, mweakungiwi muchifungu pamonga na vayaki ndava ya kukita chitututu na kukoma vandu. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Vandu vamahele vakamhambila Pilatu vakamuyupa avakitila ngati cheyavili mvelu waki. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilatu akavakota, “Wu, mwigana nivadindulilayi Nkosi wa Vayawudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Ajovili chenicho ndava vakulu vakuteta vamgotwili Yesu kwaki, ndava ya wihu.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Nambu vakulu va kuteta vakavakoakesa vandu vamuyupa Pilatu avadindulila Balaba pahali pa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilatu akavakota kavili, “Hinu, mwigana nimkita chindu kiki na mundu uyu mwemkumkemela Nkosi wa Vayawudi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Vandu voha vakajova kavili kwa lwami luvaha, “Mvamba mu msalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Nambu Pilatu akavakota, “Ndava kyani? Ahokili kyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Nambu vene vakayonjokesa kujova kwa lwami luvaha, “Mvamba pamsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilatu aganili kuuganisa msambi wa vandu, akamudindulila Balaba kuhuma muchifungu. Kangi akalagizila Yesu vamtova michapilu, kangi akamgotola vamvamba pamsalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manjolinjoli vakumvevesa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matei 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohani 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Kangi manjolinjoli vala vampeliki Yesu mugati ya luvanja lwa nyumba ya Pilatu, mkulu wa mulima, vakavakemela pamonga msambi woha wa manjolinjoli. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Vamuwaliki nyula za langi ya zambalau ngati nkosi, vabotili njingwa ya minga, vakamuwalika kumutu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Vakatumbula kumjambusa, “Tikuwoni, Nkosi wa Vayawudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Vakamtova kumutu na ndonga, vakamuhunyila mata, vakamfugamila na kumgundamila. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Pavamalili kumvevesa, vakamuhula nyula ya zambalau yila, vakamuwalika nyula zaki, kangi vakamuwusa kuvala kumvamba pamsalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ivambiwa pamsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matei 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohani 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Pevavi munjila vakonganiki na mundu mmonga liina laki Simoni, mkolonjinji wa Kulene mwene avili dadi wavi Alekizanda na Lufo. Lukumbi lwenulo apitayi kuhuma kuvala ya muji kuyingila pabomani. Manjolinjoli vakamkamula Simoni na kumgegesa msalaba weavi nawu Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Kangi vampeliki Yesu mbaka pandu pepikemelewa Goligota, maana yaki “Libangu la Mutu.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Kangi vakampela divayi yevahangisini na mtela wewukemelewa manemane, nambu Yesu abelili kunywa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Hinu vakamvamba pamsalaba, vakagavana nyula zaki, kwa gudugudu muni vamanya kila mmonga yati ipata kyani. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Yavili saa yidatu ya lukela pavamvamba pamsalaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Panani ya msalaba wula vaviki chibawu, chevayandiki matakilu gaki, mwenuyu ndi, “Nkosi wa Vayawudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Mewawa vavavambili panani ya pamisalaba vanyagaji vavili, papipi na Yesu, mmonga upandi waki wa kulyelela na yungi upandi waki wa kumangeya. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Mambu aga ndi gitimisa Mayandiku Gamsopi gegijova, “Avikiwi pamonga na vehenga gahakau.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Vandu vevapitayi pandu apo vakamliga na kunyugusa mitu yavi na kujova, “Mwe! Veve mweugwisa Nyumba ya Chapanga na kuyijenga kavili mu magono gadatu! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Hinu, huluka pamsalaba ujisangulayi wamwene!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Mewawa vakulu va kuteta pamonga na vawula va malagizu vamvevisi vajovesana vene kwa vene, “Avasangwili vangi nambu kujisangula mwene itola lepi! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Ati, mwene ndi Kilisitu, Nkosi wa Isilaeli! Hinu ahulukayi kuhuma pamsalaba muni tilola na kumsadika.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Hati vandu vala vevavambiwi pamsalaba papipi nayu, navene mewa vamligili.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ifwa pamsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matei 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohani 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Kutumbula saa sita ya muhi mbaka saa tisa, chitita chagubiki mulima woha. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Saa tisa muhi Yesu akajova kwa lwami luvaha, akajova, “Eloi, Eloi, lema sabakitani?” Mana yaki “Chapanga wangu, Chapanga wangu, ndava kyani unilekili?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Vandu vangi pagati ya vevayimili pala, pevayuwini ago, vakajova, “Yuwanila! Akumkemela Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Mundu mmonga akajumba, akajwiga chindu ngati lidodoki mudivayi yeyivava, akavika panani ya ndonga, akamvikila pamlomo akajova, “Linda tilola ngati Eliya yati ibwela kumuhulusa pamsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesu akakwesa lwami luvaha, afwili.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Hinu, lipazia la Nyumba ya Chapanga likapapuka pagati kuhuma kunani mbaka pahi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mkulu mmonga wa msambi wa manjolinjoli mweayimili palongolo yaki peamuwene Yesu cheifwa, akajova, “Chakaka mundu uyu avili Mwana wa Chapanga!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Kwavili na vadala vevalolayi chakutali, pagati yavi avi Maliya mkolonjinji wa Magidala, na Maliya nyina wavi Yakobo mdebe na Yose mewa na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Vadala ava ndi vevamlandili Yesu ku Galilaya ndava ya kumhengela. Kwavili na vadala vangi vamahele vevabwelili ku Yelusalemu pamonga nayu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Higa ya Yesu yivikiwa mu litinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matei 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohani 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Kimihi yamali kuhika, ndi yavili ligono la kutendelekela kwakona Ligono la Kupumulila. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Penapo abwelili Yosefu mkolonjinji wa ku Alimatei, mmonga pagati ya vanalibanji likulu, mweitopeswa neju. Mwene mewa alindilayi kubwela kwa Unkosi wa Chapanga. Hinu amhambalili Pilatu changali wogohi, akamuyupa apewayi higa ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilatu akakangasa kuyuwana kuvya Yesu amali kufwa. Hinu akamkemela chilongosi wa msambi wa manjolinjoli, akamkota ngati lumali kupita lukumbi lutali kutumbula Yesu peafwili. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilatu peamali kujoviwa uchakaka kuhuma kwa chilongosi wa msambi wa manjolinjoli yula kuvya Yesu amali kufwa, akamyidakila Yosefu atola higa ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosefu akagula nyula ya msopi, akayihulusa pahi higa yila, akayitindisila nyula ya msopi, akayivika mulitinda la mbugu lelahongoliwi palitalau, akabilingisa liganga pamlyangu wa litinda. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maliya mkolonjinji wa Magidala na Maliya nyina wa Yose vapawene pandu pala pevayivikili higa ya Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kuyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matei 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohani 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Palapitili Ligono la Kupumulila, Maliya mkolonjinji wa Magidala, Salome na Maliya nyina waki Yakobo vagulili mahuta gakunungalila bwina ndi vakanyala higa ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Hinu, lukela pehe ligono la Dominika, lilanga palatumbulayi kuhuma, vahikili pa litinda. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Munjila vakotanayi vene kwa vene, “Yani yati akutiwusila liganga pamlyangu wa litinda?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Nambu pavalolili, valiweni liganga limali kuwusiwa. Liganga lenilo lavili livaha neju. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Pevayingili mu litinda la mbugu, vamuweni msongolo mmonga awalili nyula yamsopi, atamili upandi wa kulyelela, vakakangasa neju.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Nambu msongolo yula akavajovela, “Mkotoka kukenyemuka. Mukumlonda Yesu wa ku Nazaleti mweavambiwi pamsalaba. Ayukili, avi lepi apa. Mlolayi, pandu pavamgonisi. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Hinu muhambayi mukavajovela vawuliwa vaki pamonga na Petili kuvya, ‘Akuvalongolela ku Galilaya, kwenuko yati mukumlola ngati cheavajovili.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ndi, vawukili vakajumba kuhuma mulitinda mula, muni vandendimi kwa wogoyi na kukangasa. Vamjovili lepi chindu mundu yeyoha, ndava muni vayogwipi neju.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhumila Maliya mundu wa Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matei 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohani 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu peayukili lukela pehe ligono la Dominika, amuhumalili hoti Maliya mundu wa Magidala, yula mweamuwusili mizuka saba. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Maliya akahamba kuvajovela vawuliwa vevavili pamonga na Yesu, na lukumbi lwenulo vavembayi na kutinda. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Nambu pevayuwini ngati Yesu avili mumi na kuvya Maliya mkolonjinji wa Magidala amuweni, vasadiki lepi.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumila vawuliwa vavili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Mwanakandayi Yesu avahumalili vawuliwa vavili vevahambayi kuchijiji. Vawuliwa avo hoti vammanyili lepi. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Vene vakahamba na kuvajovela vayavi, nambu mewawa vayavi vasadiki lepi.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumila vawuliwa kumi na mmonga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matei 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohani 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:6-8">Matei 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Pamwishu Yesu avahumalili vawuliwa kumi na mmonga pevavi pamonga pameza. Akavaywangila neju ndava vasadiki lepi na ndava ya kunonopa kwa mitima yavi, muni vavasadiki lepi vala vevamuweni peamali kuyuka. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Hinu, akavajovela, “Muhambayi pamulima woha mkakokosa Linenu la Bwina kwa vandu voha. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Mundu yeyoha mweisadika na kubatiziwa Chapanga yati akumsangula, nambu mundu yeyoha angasadika Chapanga yati akumhamula. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Na ulangisu uwu yati ulandana na vevisadika, yati vivinga mizuka kwa liina langu na kulongela kwa luga ya mupya. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Vakakamulayi liyoka amala kunywa chindu chochoha chechikoma yati vifwa lepi. Yati vakuvavikila mawoko vatamu, na yati Chapanga akuvalamisa.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu itoliwa kuhamba kunani kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Matendu 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Hinu, Bambu Yesu peamalili kulongela nawu, akatoliwa kuhamba kunani kwa Chapanga, akatama upandi wa kulyelela wa chiwoko cha Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Vawuliwa vakahamba na kukokosa Linenu la Bwina kila pandu. Bambu akahenga lihengu pamonga nawu, kukita milangisu, ndava ya kulangisa ujumbi wenuwo kumvala mwene ndi chakaka.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>